      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ba79e2e9b7d20bcdca2661e78de32562d8b9f22a.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=26b29d12343f1aa2a87f719008e83d21"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d6f904017c16804c3925729a90ebac54c2950684.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=def850b2fb8e669483538c9542889ed4"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Defend your digital world with AI.&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nothing gets past our latest Humble Tech Book Bundle: AI Cybersecurity Career Blueprint! Learn how to protect your digital world using AI defensive tactics with exceptional eBooks from Packt. Prepare for your new career with fundamental titles like &lt;em&gt;The Absolute Beginner's Guide to Cybersecurity&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Applied AI in Cyber Threat Intelligence&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;The Ultimate Ethical Hacker's Guide&lt;/em&gt;, and more! A portion of your purchase helps support our friends across the pond at BBC Children in Need. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#isc2certifiedincybersecurityccexamguide"&gt;(ISC)2 Certified in Cybersecurity (CC) Exam Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoftsecurityoperationsanalystexamrefsc-200guide"&gt;Microsoft Security Operations Analyst Exam Ref SC-200 Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ghidrasoftwarereverse-engineeringforbeginners"&gt;Ghidra Software Reverse-Engineering for Beginners&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#comptiacysapluscs0-003certificationguide"&gt;CompTIA CySA+ (CS0-003) Certification Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoftsecuritycopilot"&gt;Microsoft Security Copilot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#socanalystcareerguide"&gt;SOC Analyst Career Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or mo