edsecopsplaybook"&gt;Unified SecOps Playbook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ai-nativellmsecurity"&gt;AI-Native LLM Security&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="isc2certifiedincybersecurityccexamguide"&gt;&lt;a id="isc2certifiedincybersecurityccexamguide" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/isc2certifiedincybersecurityccexamguide_preview.pdf?t=st=1794050888~exp=1794137288~hmac=68c74db68352998cec118dff6b3bd0f11cc8e4ad8b99ac08ab986c2ed80540ab"&gt;(ISC)2 Certified in Cybersecurity (CC) Exam Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/dca614861f2bfcaa88cab7757cc73834f0f0e7ac.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ae4810f192937bd44660638cb7d94b4b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Study each CC objective with beginner-first explanations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Check your understanding of key concepts with topic quizzes that include scenario-based MCQs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Prepare for the CC exam with 2 mock exams of 125 questions each, flashcards, and exam tips&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use blueprint mapping, topic-wise MCQs, and rapid checklists for revision&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Who this book is for&lt;/h4&gt;Students and early-career IT professionals who want a structured, beginner-friendly route to the ISC2 CC exam and entry-level cybersecurity roles. Basic computer literacy helps, but no prior security experience is required.&lt;h3 id="microsoftsecurityoperationsanalystexamrefsc-200guide"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoftsecurityoperationsanalystexamrefsc-200guide" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/microsoftsecurityoperationsanalystexamrefsc-200guide_preview.pdf?t=st=1794050888~exp=1794137288~hmac=67dd5dbee5bfba5bdcae1f874caab7c804dab2d4f0a180f9b35d0c06a70aacdf"&gt;Microsoft Security Operations Analyst Exam Ref SC-200 Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/65d1b