      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7166c12319296b1679bc08b2c915522c28db33f7.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=0cde5b148c0b5e2569c595c34f60e5e7"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/327c799c3c6addfea5e2373c076e16c41cb79583.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=d7e0046901309c770e4d12c23936c9e9"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Create your own adventure&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Journey through a fantasy world of your own making with this bundle of Castles &amp; Crusades TTRPG rulebooks and resources! Learn the rules of the game and design your characters with the Players Handbook, populate your fantasy land with monsters, artifacts, treasure, and NPCs, and collect digital editions of the White and Black box sets, complete with their own storylines and adventures! Dive into a fantastical adventure of your own design with this giant bundle of Castles &amp; Crusades! Get these TTRPG resources now at the price of your choosing, and support Children’s Miracle Network with your purchase!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#shadowsofagreensky"&gt;Shadows of a Green Sky&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#swordoframi"&gt;Sword of Rami&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bookofnames"&gt;Book of Names&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#afterwinterdarkfantasysettingprimer"&gt;After Winter Dark Fantasy Setting Primer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#couponpage"&gt;Coupon Page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#classicmonsterencounter"&gt;Classic Monster Encounter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#quickthreatsandsidetreks"&gt;Quick Threats and Side Treks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#maladyofkings"&gt;Malady of Kings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#townofkalas"&gt;Town of Kalas&