      <guid isPermaLink="false">cbdad7c8350ef5963c7b23def504b10a38fd3512</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/83541c920d028e99c9bfbe428768cae8d44a0f52.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=6296587a812ba536117a2290d9c3717b"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bad379f81d0885d0a925447a7ce85b89855c8dab.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=6921b6ff9d3b9c5c5fe75b6e948a7fa2"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your world powered by Python. &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe width="400" height="250" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/qz-hLOTKjKI?si=XrQg5HFpF90W1N7R" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Step into new tech frontiers armed with the unmatched customization and power of Python, the star of our latest Tech Book Bundle with EduXpress, now with built-in simulation and interactive learning in every eBook. Pay what you want for a curated 25-eBook library that can help transform your perspective on modern tech. Discover fundamental topics like AI Development with Python, a visual deep dive into the basics of Python and AI, Large Language Models with Python, and everything else you need to dip your toes into programming. Every eBook has built-in simulation and interactive learning, so you can write and run code within the eBook itself. Plus, a portion of your purchase helps support the Python Software Foundation. Learn by doing with built-in simulation and interactive learning, all inside the eBook. Plus, a portion of your purchase helps support the Python Software Foundation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#completepythonbeginner"&gt;Complete Python Beginner&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonprogramminglogicandproblemsolving"&gt;Python Programming Logic and Problem Solving&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythondatastructures"&gt;Python Data Structures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonfunctionsandmodules"&gt;Python Functions and Modules&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonerrorhandlinganddebugging"&gt;Python Error Handling and Debugging&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt9"&gt;Pay $9 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonobject-orientedprogramming_eduxpress"&gt;Python Object-Oriented Programming&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#advancedpythonconcepts"&gt;Advanced Python Concepts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonalgorithmsfordevelopers"&gt;Python Algorithms for Developers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonfilehandlingandautomation"&gt;Python File Handling and Automation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonlibrariesandframeworks"&gt;Python Libraries and Frameworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#testinganddocumentation"&gt;Testing and Documentation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythondatabaseprogramming"&gt;Python Database Programming&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonwebdevelopmentbasics"&gt;Python Web Development Basics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonapisandbackenddevelopment"&gt;Python APIs and Backend Development&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonsoftwareengineeringpractices"&gt;Python Software Engineering Practices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#clouddeploymentforpythonapps"&gt;Cloud Deployment for Python Apps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#datasciencewithpython"&gt;Data Science with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#machinelearningfundamentals"&gt;Machine Learning Fundamentals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#deeplearningapplications"&gt;Deep Learning Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#aidevelopmentwithpython"&gt;AI Development with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#largelanguagemodelswithpython"&gt;Large Language Models with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildingaichatbotswithpython"&gt;Building AI Chatbots with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#aiagentdevelopmentusingpython"&gt;AI Agent Development Using Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#creatingai-poweredpythonprojects"&gt;Creating AI-Powered Python Projects&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythondeveloperinterviewpreparation"&gt;Python Developer Interview Preparation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="completepythonbeginner"&gt;&lt;a id="completepythonbeginner"&gt;Complete Python Beginner&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/79581cabd490ac6ff0f31cf450e3c47afc58fc5d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=738a97a0af45e29b6648a9de5ccf7f57"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Complete Python Beginner. Starts from zero and takes you through Python syntax, variables, data types, operators, and your first working programs. Covers conditionals, loops, functions, basic data structures, file handling, and an introduction to OOP, ending with beginner projects like a finance calculator and a grade management system, so you finish with a genuine working foundation in Python.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonprogramminglogicandproblemsolving"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonprogramminglogicandproblemsolving"&gt;Python Programming Logic and Problem Solving&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0735a86fc32a2055efc97600ccf2facc586b772e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=80b26d71826b4f6a1e8dde8f750891de"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python Programming Logic and Problem Solving. Focused on the thinking behind the code rather than just syntax. You'll learn computational thinking, problem decomposition, flowcharts, pseudocode, algorithm design, and decision-making logic, then apply it through projects like a loan approval system and an AI recommendation prototype. This is where you learn to actually plan a solution before writing it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythondatastructures"&gt;&lt;a id="pythondatastructures"&gt;Python Data Structures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0ae91fc5a55a555b44c32e54d3e443152376b19c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1426f43f282197f3c850512647a9ca5c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python Data Structures. A thorough walkthrough of lists, tuples, sets, dictionaries, stacks, queues, linked lists, trees, and graphs, including when to use each one. It also covers the collections module and how these structures are used to organize data in AI and machine learning systems, closing with a knowledge management system project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonfunctionsandmodules"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonfunctionsandmodules"&gt;Python Functions and Modules&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8ee21e4a267bc40b97a851733b6a7f47a573e6cc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a2927d3091e368281e147da0b491d7d9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python Functions and Modules. Covers writing clean, reusable functions with parameters, return values, and proper scope, then moves into organizing code with modules and packages, including pip and PyPI. It also introduces functional programming tools like map, filter, and lambda, and shows how functions form the backbone of automation and AI application design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonerrorhandlinganddebugging"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonerrorhandlinganddebugging"&gt;Python Error Handling and Debugging&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3b1a504942e2b22eb607641a4b384e82639fce6f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=820ac3f0c64ed4eb13aa1b63a1bac327"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python Error Handling and Debugging. Teaches you to recognize syntax, runtime, and logical errors, then handle them properly using try, except, and finally, including custom exceptions. You'll also learn debugging tools, logging, defensive programming, and testing basics with unittest and pytest, building the reliability skills needed for production-quality code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt9"&gt;Pay $9 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonobject-orientedprogramming_eduxpress"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonobject-orientedprogramming_eduxpress"&gt;Python Object-Oriented Programming&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3d5a0a3d4bb1deaecafdf098ba1fc573bb1d6901.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=da1bb2ee4826a7d9bc31abab234a1f0b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python Object Oriented Programming. Covers classes, objects, constructors, attributes, and methods, then builds into encapsulation, inheritance, polymorphism, and abstraction. It also introduces design patterns, magic methods, and composition, showing how OOP underlies most real Python applications and AI frameworks like scikit-learn and TensorFlow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="advancedpythonconcepts"&gt;&lt;a id="advancedpythonconcepts"&gt;Advanced Python Concepts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/25424c5522ae8493744c03f826cc6d2fec7eb9cb.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5cbc7ffc5808d6d0f03ee8578e3c91e5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advanced Python Concepts. Goes beyond the basics into comprehensions, generators, decorators, context managers, and advanced OOP techniques like metaclasses and operator overloading. It also covers type hints, concurrency with threading and async programming, memory management, and performance optimization, the skills that separate intermediate coders from advanced developers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonalgorithmsfordevelopers"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonalgorithmsfordevelopers"&gt;Python Algorithms for Developers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4efdeb947b827d2d3681eb51cd43580d3a4fd8f9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1688cb25f6e2f9571f58cb8e121ab9d0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python Algorithms for Developers. Introduces algorithm design and efficiency through Big O notation, searching and sorting algorithms, recursion, and graph traversal methods like BFS and DFS. It also touches on hashing, algorithm optimization, and the algorithmic thinking behind machine learning and AI systems, with a strong focus on coding interview preparation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonfilehandlingandautomation"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonfilehandlingandautomation"&gt;Python File Handling and Automation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/720198195bcbde6149f22ff2babd47f2976d13fd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f920063fbdfd0f91aeeeaa6117610a7c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python File Handling and Automation. Teaches reading and writing text, CSV, JSON, and other file formats, then moves into automating file organization, batch processing, and regex-based text extraction. It also covers web and API automation, email automation, and how these skills feed directly into data pipelines and AI dataset preparation.Python File Handling and Automation. Teaches reading and writing text, CSV, JSON, and other file formats, then moves into automating file organization, batch processing, and regex-based text extraction. It also covers web and API automation, email automation, and how these skills feed directly into data pipelines and AI dataset preparation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonlibrariesandframeworks"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonlibrariesandframeworks"&gt;Python Libraries and Frameworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/951c1921ad0cc1cb9b8e0709075d8ad1c3e122f3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d67f3fd3b9e5e13c62061d904ea93c40"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python Libraries and Frameworks. A guided tour of the Python ecosystem, covering NumPy, Pandas, visualization tools, machine learning libraries like scikit-learn, deep learning frameworks like TensorFlow and PyTorch, NLP libraries, and web frameworks like Flask and Django. It's designed to help you choose the right tool instead of building everything from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="testinganddocumentation"&gt;&lt;a id="testinganddocumentation"&gt;Testing and Documentation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7b5c57a8db1ee550ec827ea0d31e1bebd152c5e4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e22a53868aff2103eafbf8e2a38be5ed"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Testing and Documentation. Covers writing unit, integration, and end-to-end tests with pytest, including fixtures and mocking, plus how to test APIs, databases, and even AI and LLM applications. It also teaches professional documentation practices, from README files to API docs, the skills that separate hobby code from team-ready code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythondatabaseprogramming"&gt;&lt;a id="pythondatabaseprogramming"&gt;Python Database Programming&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/da18d69a5b9359077becd1598ba36adddc71a5c7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ea705a75ed9e729051365b812f15b6a7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python Database Programming. Teaches relational database concepts, SQL fundamentals, and how to connect Python to SQLite, PostgreSQL, and MySQL using both raw queries and SQLAlchemy's ORM. It also covers database design, security against SQL injection, and an introduction to NoSQL and vector databases used in AI memory systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonwebdevelopmentbasics"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonwebdevelopmentbasics"&gt;Python Web Development Basics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/24f239f6790596c57e55d7ef8dac3f74b20e0a25.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=42b0fd8e2fa12d4e7054b9de9f0e215d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python Web Development Basics. Introduces how the web works, then walks through building applications with Flask, Django, and FastAPI, covering routing, templates, forms, and databases. It also touches on authentication basics and connecting AI features to a web backend, giving you a real entry point into full-stack development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonapisandbackenddevelopment"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonapisandbackenddevelopment"&gt;Python APIs and Backend Development&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/57007e50b759d690eb45d0c070066e17c31edaae.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0657d527fb0f2bbac7e10b75fc32843f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python APIs and Backend Development. Covers REST API design, building APIs with Flask and FastAPI, handling requests and responses, and connecting APIs to databases with CRUD operations. It also covers authentication, security, consuming external APIs, and building backend systems that support AI services and agents.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonsoftwareengineeringpractices"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonsoftwareengineeringpractices"&gt;Python Software Engineering Practices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/005090d985e24d12f4c21f2b3e355614ef177108.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=05ff8ad911cb02207d4770bccb0ed46b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python Software Engineering Practices. Focuses on writing clean, maintainable code, structuring professional projects, using Git for version control, and applying design principles like separation of concerns. It also covers dependency management, code quality tools, testing, logging, security, and CI/CD basics, the practices that make you employable on a real team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="clouddeploymentforpythonapps"&gt;&lt;a id="clouddeploymentforpythonapps"&gt;Cloud Deployment for Python Apps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b058b7ca8f372245341fa7231868c2a893f0ae72.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=680c9b04f85539ac361eb837e7912b63"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cloud Deployment for Python Apps. Teaches how to prepare, containerize with Docker, and deploy Python applications to the cloud, including databases, networking, and HTTPS setup. It also covers deploying AI and machine learning services, serverless functions, CI/CD pipelines, and monitoring, taking your projects from your laptop to the live internet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="datasciencewithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="datasciencewithpython"&gt;Data Science with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7e107a90b7db8ec771de6947ad1a227efeca9753.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=303ec408d05c59e59e93d3dc55911b18"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Data Science with Python. Covers the full data science workflow using NumPy and Pandas, including data cleaning, exploratory data analysis, statistics, and visualization with Matplotlib and Seaborn. It closes by connecting these skills directly to preparing datasets for machine learning and AI applications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="machinelearningfundamentals"&gt;&lt;a id="machinelearningfundamentals"&gt;Machine Learning Fundamentals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c6e694b2b6245e8c56c0d77ee9832f4d58e0ea73.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=35fdfc54a2e9e0b8a7db2d10714a392a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Machine Learning Fundamentals. Introduces supervised, unsupervised, and reinforcement learning, then walks through regression, classification, and clustering algorithms using scikit-learn. It also covers model evaluation, feature engineering, and building complete ML pipelines, giving you a genuine foundation rather than just buzzwords.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="deeplearningapplications"&gt;&lt;a id="deeplearningapplications"&gt;Deep Learning Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e2d3afe196f6d2fb2aea3249be1087c136044260.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=118286234b3ce033bc5f6814ba84650c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deep Learning Applications. Covers neural network fundamentals, training with backpropagation and gradient descent, and building models with PyTorch and TensorFlow. It goes into computer vision with CNNs, sequence models like RNNs and LSTMs, and transformers, the architecture behind modern language models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="aidevelopmentwithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="aidevelopmentwithpython"&gt;AI Development with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/24d0d5e664f8cf332cc73345011aa6aeb6533396.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3ccc69bf924d8c4e31941017eda35bf0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI Development with Python. Bridges machine learning theory with practical application building, covering AI APIs, prompt engineering, retrieval-augmented generation, and building AI assistants with tools and memory. It's a hands-on course that shows you how to actually ship AI-powered features, not just understand them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="largelanguagemodelswithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="largelanguagemodelswithpython"&gt;Large Language Models with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c82aa6a25c9a534543e8451f2dc0ea3fd11b41ae.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ccb17054b327496fc6c0d46723052ea9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Large Language Models with Python. Explains how LLMs work under the hood, from tokenization and embeddings to transformer architecture, then teaches you to call LLM APIs, engineer prompts, and validate structured outputs. It also covers open-source models, semantic search, vector databases, RAG pipelines, and tool use, one of the most in-demand skill sets right now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildingaichatbotswithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="buildingaichatbotswithpython"&gt;Building AI Chatbots with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8e2aa42f0b2acdfdb3719af4c3c2b86423213d9f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=388c0b7eaa1976f583bfffa55d070916"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Building AI Chatbots with Python. Takes you from simple rule-based chatbots to full LLM-powered conversational systems with memory, retrieval, and tool integration. You'll build chatbots with web interfaces, database-backed user accounts, and even multimodal capabilities, ending with a genuinely deployable AI chatbot platform.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="aiagentdevelopmentusingpython"&gt;&lt;a id="aiagentdevelopmentusingpython"&gt;AI Agent Development Using Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2b565c448bd057d4f56f4f676d857e23d90bcbb5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=04214353ff68e1aa67f2afcf0225b745"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;AI Agent Development Using Python. Covers the architecture behind autonomous AI agents, including planning, tool use, memory, and multi-step workflows. It also introduces multi-agent systems and popular agent frameworks, positioning you at the front of one of the fastest-moving areas in AI development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="creatingai-poweredpythonprojects"&gt;&lt;a id="creatingai-poweredpythonprojects"&gt;Creating AI-Powered Python Projects&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8ad0fd412f18865af687a40112c1ab4b9851c80e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=47bd1c447e6689112999c5526c4af987"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Python Developer Interview Preparation. Covers Python fundamentals, data structures, algorithms, OOP, and debugging through practice questions, alongside API, database, and AI/ML interview topics. It also includes coding challenges, system design discussion, and behavioral interview prep using the STAR method, turning your skills into an actual job offer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythondeveloperinterviewpreparation"&gt;&lt;a id="pythondeveloperinterviewpreparation"&gt;Python Developer Interview Preparation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8c739169bb15901c0808b1c1b57dcffe6aa78c10.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ce041b474575e585fa78391f2bc2dd66"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Creating AI-Powered Python Projects. A capstone-style guide that pulls together everything from the bundle into complete, portfolio-ready builds, including an AI research assistant, a productivity assistant, a data analysis platform, and a business automation agent. It closes with a full-stack capstone project covering architecture, testing, security, and cloud deployment, turning scattered skills into a real, demonstrable body of work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
