      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/267346bcb1b57a70a0cd1b17e3ddbcf8d80103a2.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=b823b1c4a37471f82d582b393005fa78"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9c224c4daef231183783cd982a9669683e3b5496.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=0886e396e8dbd80d4da7c8298085d922"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Original comics from Absolute legends&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;It takes a real brain trust of creativity and talent to shape an entire superhero universe, and the creators behind DC’s paradigm-shifting Absolute Universe comics are some of the best around. Because their previous work deserves to be celebrated just as much, we’ve teamed up with Image Comics to bring you an &lt;em&gt;absolutely&lt;/em&gt; massive bundle of fantastic creator-owned comic series from each of these one-of-a-kind writers. Journey across the Earth with the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse in Jonathan Hickman’s &lt;em&gt;East of West&lt;/em&gt;! Solve a supernatural crime in Kelly Thompson’s sci-fi/fantasy/detective mashup &lt;em&gt;Black Cloak&lt;/em&gt;! Take on the villains of Alabama’s sinister Craw County in Jason Aaron’s &lt;em&gt;Southern Bastards&lt;/em&gt;! Unravel the mystery of the otherworldly Black Barn in Jeff Lemire’s &lt;em&gt;Gideon Falls&lt;/em&gt;! Discover the deadly secrets of what was once the United States in Scott Snyder’s &lt;em&gt;Undiscovered Country&lt;/em&gt;! All of these and more are included in this bundle of nearly 100 volumes of fantastic comics by the masterminds behind Absolute, so grab them now at the price of your choosing and support BINC with your purchase! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ad_afterdeath_book1"&gt;AD AFTER DEATH BOOK 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#blackcloak_vol1"&gt;BLACK CLOAK, VOL. 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#eastofwest_vol1"&gt;EAST OF WEST, VOL. 1&lt