      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/27fee77aba61ac96bf14dd8e7c60f7fb320313cb.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=e233ab98747a67e870d40dbfaf2bf041"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d190375b2881929ef71352004f5c67ea6b88190a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=45b0716a1f3b516320a0f666190c05d2"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Chart your own path to map making&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Passionate about building maps to great game worlds? Say hello to the Map Making MEGA Bundle. Whether it's dungeons and floorplans, starships and solar systems or even entire worlds, this treasure trove of assets and apps has what you need for your cartography. It includes practically everything either released by map-making experts ProFantasy Software, including the latest CC3+, Cartographer's Annual Vol. 1–17, every symbol set, dungeon, city and overland app they've ever released.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#symbolset1_fantasyoverland"&gt;Symbol Set 1: Fantasy Overland&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tokentreasury_monsters1"&gt;Token Treasury: Monsters 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#sourcesmapscastles"&gt;Source Maps: Castles!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#sourcemaps_cities"&gt;Source Maps: Cities!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#campaigncartograher3pluslicenseextension"&gt;Campaign Cartographer 3+&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#symbolset6_isometriccities"&gt;Symbol Set 6: Isometric Cities&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tomeofultimatemapping"&gt;Tome of Ultimate Mapping&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol1"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fractalterrains3"&gt;Fractal Terrains 3+&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dungeondesigner3"&gt;Dungeon Designer 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#citydesigner3"&gt;City Designer 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cosmographer3plus"&gt;Cosmographer 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#perspectives3"&gt;Perspectives 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dioramas3"&gt;Dioramas 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#characterartist3"&gt;Character Artist 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#symbolset2fantasyfloorplans"&gt;Symbol Set 2: Fantasy Floorplans&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#symbolset3_modern"&gt;Symbol Set 3: Modern&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#symbolset4_dungeonsofschley"&gt;Symbol Set 4: Dungeons of Schley&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#symbols_citiesofschley"&gt;Symbol Set 5: Cities of Schley&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tokentreasury_monsters2"&gt;Token Treasury: Monsters 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#sourcemapstemplestombsandcatacombs"&gt;Source Maps: Temples, Tombs and Catacombs!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#worldwar2interactiveatlas"&gt;World War 2 Interactive Atlas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#worldbuilderscompendium"&gt;World Builder's Compendium&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol2"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol3"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol4"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol5"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol6"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol7"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol8"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol9"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol10"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol11"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol12"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 12&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol13"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 13&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol14"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol15"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 15&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol16"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 16&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cartographersannualvol17"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 17&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="symbolset1_fantasyoverland"&gt;&lt;a id="symbolset1_fantasyoverland"&gt;Symbol Set 1: Fantasy Overland&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/304a96fdcb636f6fc8218bc737a4b2bbb8669324.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=43e492b4840e38e29c20f0c9dbd87048"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Symbol Set 1 - Fantasy Overland adds four fabulous new symbol styles to CC3+. There are more than 2,500 new symbols in SS1, each one painstakingly crafted by expert fantasy artists. And their pain is your benefit. A symbol that took hours to create can be added to a map in moments. With these new Fantasy Overland symbols you can make the most beautiful, distinctive CC3+ maps yet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SS1 is easy to use and integrates with your existing CC3+ styles. Pick a new SS1 starting template and map-making style, and CC3+'s drawing tools make it easy to add the right background elements. The new symbols are now just a mouse click away.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you use other design programs such as PhotoShop and GIMP to create maps, you can use our high resolution icons and textures with them, too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tokentreasury_monsters1"&gt;&lt;a id="tokentreasury_monsters1"&gt;Token Treasury: Monsters 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/82db38b3b373ae37a425e44afc9a5e043309cc0c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=86592cee5cb5548d29f07b5948937d1c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Token Treasury: Monsters gives you a huge selection of creatures and characters to populate your CC3+ maps and virtual tabletops. TT:M is designed for use with any virtual table-top software such as roll20, Battlegrounds, d20pro and Fantasy grounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;TT:M contains more than 750 monster tokens crafted by fantasy artist Rich Longmore. It includes 118 creatures as well as a set of 24 rectangular and circular frames to denote a creature's combat role: melee, ranged, magical or boss.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;TT:M also installs symbol catalogs, templates and drawing tools for CC3+. Create custom tokens with varicolour backgrounds and add your own frames and mirror the tokens to add variations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open then, if you dare, the Token Treasury: Monsters!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sourcesmapscastles"&gt;&lt;a id="sourcesmapscastles"&gt;Source Maps: Castles!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/efd057b7280f4263e22e73549722e330eacc4506.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=937fba25ad8d8ee2c089f8acbaed2d2b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether your characters need a stronghold, your villain needs an impregnable bastion, or your miniatures need a fort to besiege, SM:C is what you need to fire your imagination.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SM:C offers 25 archetypal castle layouts with surroundings and 3D views supplied in PDF, PNG and CC3+ format. Based on floorplans of the historical castles with conjectural details, the plans paint a complete picture of these fortifications in their heyday. SM:C also offers you images, historical detail and fantasy adventure material to use in your favourite RPG.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SM:C also expands CC3+ with new drawing tools, 470 map tokens including fiendish siege machinery and castle fixtures, templates and powerful new drawing tools to create stylish castles of your own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sourcemaps_cities"&gt;&lt;a id="sourcemaps_cities"&gt;Source Maps: Cities!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f4e9f98832f712db62e17df97e192cd1ecbc3e27.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=01e9dbf5385f62f5792dbf8a4efd2baa"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From the splendor of ancient Babylon to the squalor of medieval York, SM:Cities gives you the magic of eight fully-mapped cities and more than 70 urban floorplans, from immense temple complexes to Viking halls and longboats.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With detailed city plans, isometric views and numerous floor plans, plus extensive yet richly-detailed historical and adventure material, this is an unparalleled resource for game masters and historians alike.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The maps are available in png, CC3+ and as 150-page PDF.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Finally, if you have CC3+, SM:Cities adds new tools to help you create more villages, towns and cities, or change the ones in this Source Maps collection. The tools include a selection of symbols, templates and powerful new drawing tools to create stylish settlements of your own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="campaigncartograher3pluslicenseextension"&gt;&lt;a id="campaigncartograher3pluslicenseextension"&gt;Campaign Cartographer 3+&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ee7d75232505a4346120779ecae67b67f5a5ca2c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=40790e95584f8a02bf26a15aad39af9e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you’re a gamer who loves maps, you need CC3+!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CC3+ is the most powerful and versatile map-making software for gamers. From entire worlds, to overland maps, villages, cities and dungeons, CC3+ gives you all the tools, styles and art assets you need to create stunning cartography. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Authors, games designers and more than 100,000 gamers have mapped out the worlds of their imagination with CC3+.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use powerful graphic effects to enhance your map, add a hex or square grid and link your maps together to build an interactive atlas of your campaign. When you are done, print or export your maps for private or commercial use, or for virtual desktops such as roll20.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you use other design programs such as PhotoShop and GIMP to create maps, you can use our high resolution assets and textures with them, too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This tier includes the permanent license. All our software includes a ten-year download guarantee, full update and upgrade rights and commercial rights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="symbolset6_isometriccities"&gt;&lt;a id="symbolset6_isometriccities"&gt;Symbol Set 6: Isometric Cities&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/435ddd51dbd90f7d0f64a8c68776f123368c0245.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dd9adfbde972c0458149d0c5e60a2033"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;From the sprawling imagination of award-winning cartographer Mike Schley comes a new way to portray your urban settings in Campaign Cartographer 3 Plus, featuring leaning shanties, decrepit ruins, gleaming palaces and soaring towers all in glorious isometric perspective.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unashamedly old school in outlook, but with the quality and beauty you'd expect from a master mapmaker, the Isometric Cities features hundreds of high-resolution symbols and textures and all the tools, effects and templates you need to create breath-taking city views of your own. All buildings and objects, be they houses, workshops, city walls, tombs and crypts, boats and wagons, or shrubs and trees - come in four cardinal views so you see and display them from all sides.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you use other design programs such as PhotoShop and GIMP to create maps, you can use our high resolution assets and textures with them, too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tomeofultimatemapping"&gt;&lt;a id="tomeofultimatemapping"&gt;Tome of Ultimate Mapping&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fc40493ffea59a0ce9cb40feac1445fdd6befd5c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b2ac706cb6e65394e5ad78844fe45400"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Tome of Ultimate Mapping is the complete guide to making great maps with all of ProFantasy’s software.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you are a new user or an expert, this all-in-one 760-page updated Tome will give you tips and techniques to make better maps with CC3+ and all add-ons. The Tome PDF is accompanied by over 110MB of support files; example maps, symbol catalogs, tutorial files and templates.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The richly illustrated Tome includes the collated wisdom of many expert map-makers. It gives you unrivalled access to new cartographic styles that will increase the attractiveness and utility of your maps. Beginners will appreciate the extensive tutorials giving a gentle introduction, while power-users will get the most from the command reference and macro information. It’s any cartographer’s essential companion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol1"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol1"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e492ab425cd70c38f9db54a7598c1fd6287a32aa.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9f4611792c7803b3c0f4327e001eec58"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Mercator&lt;/strong&gt; style pack which captures the flair and style of 16th and 17th century cartographers.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;John Speed&lt;/strong&gt; style emulates the famous town and city maps of the masterful British cartographer of that name.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The&lt;strong&gt; Gothic Cathedral&lt;/strong&gt; is a beautifully rendered floorplan with additional drawing tools.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="fractalterrains3"&gt;&lt;a id="fractalterrains3"&gt;Fractal Terrains 3+&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/09c6fda17d07775dbf90f6d347dbea5b0ce7c05c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=958c37db3f5947d14ded9fc6bc4d0b7d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create the best of all possible worlds!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want to build as many worlds as you like, in seconds? Want to carve out continents and move mountains with just your mouse? Want to take real world Earth and Mars data then make the world your own? Welcome to FT3+!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;FT3+ is a powerful and versatile stand-alone world generator. Generate random planets then fine-tune an infinite number of details for the ultimate in realism. FT3 gives you control of all the elements: colouration, meteor craters, sea level, land-mass size, height range, world circumference, water courses, and much more. You can import and modify real planetary data, generate spectacular new worlds at random, or build your own terra firma literally from the ground up, then sculpt the landscape to fit your plan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;When done, create beautiful high resolution exports of any part of your world into CC3+ or any other graphics program and play away.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dungeondesigner3"&gt;&lt;a id="dungeondesigner3"&gt;Dungeon Designer 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/01f79a8e77c43785a1508f5493a682e6e799cb30.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=14e14d2aa66d5736615f9df760f16079"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you're a Game Master you obviously take your gaming seriously, and the Dungeon Designer 3 add-on for CC3+ is the quickest and easiest way to bring serious realism, excitement, and true nastiness to your dungeons and floorplans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you're designing a complete dungeon or the floorplan for your local inn, DD3 gives you all the tools you'll ever need to create corridors, caves and rooms of all shapes and sizes, plus more than 500 stunning icons, from simple doors and windows to devious traps, ornate coffins, lifelike statues, sacred altars, tempting treasure, and more. Add a hex or square grid, export and you are ready to go.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; If you use other design programs such as PhotoShop and GIMP to create maps, you can use our high resolution icons and textures with them, too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="citydesigner3"&gt;&lt;a id="citydesigner3"&gt;City Designer 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/67a49337c4af4556fc3ede691dfcbbd9893962b3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fb4437d2f8dd263caa1458aafb4c2194"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;From the smallest village to the greatest metropolis, the City Designer 3 add-on for CC3+ lets you create beautiful, incredibly detailed city maps with ease and speed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;CD3 gives you control over every aspect of city creation. Specify everything from the direction of the sun, to the style and shape of each house. Select a house and it will even generate an outline floorplan and link it to your map. Create an entire street of different buildings with just two clicks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;CD3 includes 2,000 new map tokens for 12 styles such as Fantasy, SF, Present-day, Gothic, Orcish, Elvish and Classical.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you use other design programs such as PhotoShop and GIMP to create maps, you can use our high resolution icons and textures with them, too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cosmographer3plus"&gt;&lt;a id="cosmographer3plus"&gt;Cosmographer 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3b03130601580c293441d62b12dc86f3b4cc6743.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=41285c5c77b0e9843580600013df26c1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to the future of map-making&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With the Cosmographer 3 add-on to CC3+ you can design starships, solar systems, worlds and even galaxies! You get easy-to-use drawing tools, textures and a palette of several thousand symbols in multiple styles to construct SF cartography for any game system. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Starship deckplans with connecting symbols&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Star maps in 3D and 2D&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Solar systems&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;World maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Local area maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A huge array of maps for the Traveller RPG&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you use other design programs such as PhotoShop and GIMP to create maps, you can use our high resolution assets and textures with them, too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="perspectives3"&gt;&lt;a id="perspectives3"&gt;Perspectives 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f7b3f9c14d0e3405df5e94901442458e2847e6f6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=45ec744ba09270b6d0365f921dfe8ad2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add a new dimension to your map-making!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create beautifully rendered, 3D isometric plans of your palace, dungeon, pyramid, tavern or village. Wherever your games take you, Perspectives 3 gives you the plans to bring them to vivid life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use powerful drawing tools to create walls, solid shapes and floors at any angle; apply colour schemes that vary with the light direction. Use existing 2D plans and give 2D objects depth by sketching out their base, then extruding them. Decorate your rooms from a huge array of fantasy symbols. And the best part is that it’s so easy to do: Perspectives 3 doesn't require any specialist knowledge.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; If you use other design programs such as PhotoShop and GIMP, you can use the more than 800 color map tokens, textures in two different styles to create maps, too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dioramas3"&gt;&lt;a id="dioramas3"&gt;Dioramas 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/55961494de75e9697976cd841961c57738f3eb4a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6f559ba8c603c45064e42ed82d3dc001"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dioramas 3 is the add-on to CC3+ for drawing, printing and assembling 3d paper scenery for your games. Hundreds of symbols and fill styles, many different templates and a large variety of examples provide the tools to create your own 3d paper models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dioramas 3 helps you design anything from the most complex fortress to the simplest hovel, from dungeons to starships, to virtually anything you can imagine. And you don’t have to be a modelling genius. All you need to do is plug together basic nets (cut-outs) to give you any number of final models. The cut-lines, glue-tabs and fold-lines are pre-marked for supreme simplicity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Automated printing tools let you print any model at any common miniature scale on the click of a button.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="characterartist3"&gt;&lt;a id="characterartist3"&gt;Character Artist 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/50b65ccdf68e89065e585dba33a85946c2cfa06d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4f9b41cc1c6c40cf3476b11bf44984c6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you are a Game Master who needs custom miniatures, or a general in need of an army, you can bring new art to your games with the Character Artist 3 add-on for CC3+.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you want a full-length portrait for your character sheet or unlimited stand-up counters for your RPG, the Character Artist 3 add-on for CC3 is the tool for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Character Artist 3 lets you create attractive, high-quality portraits of characters for your games. Building characters is simple. Select from the basic races such as human, elf and dwarf, or choose horrific humanoid monsters. Just click on icons to choose the race and sex, then select body parts and clothes to build your portrait. One mouse click to choose, then another to place, and you've added the feature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="symbolset2fantasyfloorplans"&gt;&lt;a id="symbolset2fantasyfloorplans"&gt;Symbol Set 2: Fantasy Floorplans&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c1780159c23bd1066b404a39856a6958f9d236e2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b2c99e4a3f914e720a65664140020282"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Symbol Set 2: Fantasy Floorplans includes 2500 amazing new map tokens in four distinctive styles for delving dungeons, caves and floorplans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every new token is a mini-masterpiece, and although they took our experts thousands of hours to create, you can add them to your maps in seconds. So whatever your design skill, your floorplans can be stunning works of art. There are photorealistic and hand-drawn styles of furnishings, fixtures, traps, treasure, monsters, characters and sundry items - everything you need to design great dungeons, caves and floorplans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you use other design programs such as PhotoShop and GIMP to create maps, you can use our high resolution icons and textures with them, too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="symbolset3_modern"&gt;&lt;a id="symbolset3_modern"&gt;Symbol Set 3: Modern&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b4267ea5d139f4c83677bc108b7042eec01a600b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c2af70f2638379d8089104152ad96c0e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Symbol Set 3: Modern includes approximately 1000 bitmap and another 1000 vector symbols of present-day objects for close-up scenes of houses, offices, public buildings and city streets. Another 500 symbols are CAD-style line art symbols, suitable for creating blueprint-like drawings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For overland maps there are approximately 75 symbols and more than 120 drawing tools, recreating the styles used by governmental mapping agencies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you use other design programs such as PhotoShop and GIMP to create maps, you can use our high resolution assets and textures with them, too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="symbolset4_dungeonsofschley"&gt;&lt;a id="symbolset4_dungeonsofschley"&gt;Symbol Set 4: Dungeons of Schley&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/af6ba8fff64df352d5782e1778711df0a5e91b12.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8c0f7b9c92e3572900d49c30af9a06ae"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From the fiendish imagination of award-winning Dungeons and Dragons® cartographer Mike Schley comes a whole new style of dungeon for CC3+ and other design software, featuring devious traps, lurking horrors, breath-taking hoards and ancient architecture.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unashamedly old school in outlook, but with the quality and beauty you'd expect from a master mapmaker, The Dungeons of Schley features more than a thousand high-resolution symbols and textures and all the tools, effects and templates you need to create knock-out dungeons of your own. There are two styles - one gorgeous full colour, the other in black and white inks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There are furnishings, fixtures, traps, treasure and sundry items - everything you need to design great dungeons.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you use other design programs such as PhotoShop and GIMP to create maps, you can use our high resolution assets and textures with them, too&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="symbols_citiesofschley"&gt;&lt;a id="symbols_citiesofschley"&gt;Symbol Set 5: Cities of Schley&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e3f17b3d5194b98677f4645d40c882de7a4ebc96.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=028596559e619c261d97e87bb4b50ab2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;From the sprawling imagination of award-winning &lt;em&gt;Dungeons and Dragon&lt;/em&gt;s® cartographer Mike Schley comes a whole new style of cities for CC3+ and other design software, featuring decrepit ruins, bustling inns, gleaming palaces and soaring towers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inspired by the old-school, reimagined for today, Cities of Schley features more than six hundred high-resolution symbols and textures and all the tools, effects and templates you need to create breath-taking cities of your own. A simple setting allows you to transform a full-colour map into a black &amp;amp; white illustration, or a sepia-colored parchment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;There are houses,workshops, city walls, tombs and crypts, boats and wagons, shrubs and trees - everything you need to design great cities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you use other design programs such as PhotoShop and GIMP to create maps, you can use our high resolution assets and textures with them, too.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tokentreasury_monsters2"&gt;&lt;a id="tokentreasury_monsters2"&gt;Token Treasury: Monsters 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b11cc718d429a47970840ce5ed643d8b74c16dea.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c3df28bda87d520faddda3c19b799766"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Expanding on the first set of monsters, this collection gives you another, completely new set of critters and foes to face on the virtual tabletop. TT:M2 is designed for use with any virtual table-top software such as roll20, Battlegrounds, d20pro and Fantasy grounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;TT:M2 contains another 700+ monster tokens crafted by fantasy artist Rich Longmore. It includes 100 creatures as well as a set of 32 frames and direction arrows to denote a creature's combat role and facing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;TT:M2 also installs symbol catalogs, templates and drawing tools for CC3+. Create custom tokens with varicolour backgrounds and add your own frames and mirror the tokens to add variations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Open then, if you dare, the Token Treasury: Monsters 2!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sourcemapstemplestombsandcatacombs"&gt;&lt;a id="sourcemapstemplestombsandcatacombs"&gt;Source Maps: Temples, Tombs and Catacombs!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bf46291700525fba338f28b9f9aac95d71cbdec2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3d9d61182022911e4394f7e07d8a98e4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether your priest needs a home, your vampire needs a crypt, or your players need a dark ritual to interrupt, Source Maps: Temples, Tombs and Catacombs is what you need to fire your imagination.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From the majestic Great Pyramid to the prehistoric megaliths of Stonehenge, SM:TTC gives you 25 of the finest sacred sites you'll find anywhere in PDF, PNG and CC3+ format. With detailed floor plans, 3D views and surroundings, plus incredible historical and adventure material, this is an unparalleled resource for game masters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SM:TTC also expands CC3+ with tools to help you create more sacred sites, or change the ones included here. The tools include 320+ map tokens and powerful new drawing tools to create stylish sites of your own.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="worldwar2interactiveatlas"&gt;&lt;a id="worldwar2interactiveatlas"&gt;World War 2 Interactive Atlas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e0b5fa9501eda8f01a01f7e97615f1043a40ad66.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6fa74b7b81afde514f366bd17e082dbf"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dive into action with the WWII Interactive Atlas&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Covering every month of every theatre of World War II, this huge atlas is for wargamers and anyone interested in World War II. It provides a highly interactive and thought-provoking view of the war, and is a great starting point for what-if scenarios. Each map contains date, movement, unit strengths and other military details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From the world overview you can cycle through each month of the conflict, watching the changing events unfold. Click on important areas to bring up more detailed maps of the conflict. For example, punch down through the European maps to see Omaha Beach, the Battle for Stalingrad and the Raid on St Nazaire.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="worldbuilderscompendium"&gt;&lt;a id="worldbuilderscompendium" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/worldbuilderscompendium_preview.pdf?t=st=1794050909~exp=1794137309~hmac=0a17c8d59ac46e76de1c79b63dd6d0c6050cbd0295eae7e65d0675e43a3e7a1b"&gt;World Builder's Compendium&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d296a9345d3d228bd3e12c997a0adee06ca9594d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=018f99ae924108b6b59579d5f1c04569"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A treasure trove of mapping articles and resources for ProFantasy’s range of software, compiled by master mapper Remy Monsen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Within these pages, you will find inspiring articles for all skill levels. Some focus on artistry, others are packed with worldbuilding tips to help you make believable maps, yet more give you an inside track on getting the most out of ProFantasy’s software.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The World Builder’s Compendium features a 350-page PDF, maps and other support files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Alongside the Compendium, we’ve also included twelve additional tutorials, styles and techniques including creating your own interactive atlas, shaded relief maps, and map projections.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol2"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol2"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/321a06f7bc7409e98a3f708fa6f8864d4247670a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c9d4e87f8ca8d4615e239047377a67a3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Pete Fenlon &lt;/strong&gt;issue adapts the classic rpg and map designer’s designs to CC3+ in a beautiful overland style.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lighted Dungeons &lt;/strong&gt;teaches you how to add atmospheric lighting to dungeon maps or other floorplans.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Star System&lt;/strong&gt; style lets you create stellar science fiction maps.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol3"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol3"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f42253e1f5efa570c877b0df06efdf68432f4c06.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fdbda43fdeaaec2b905d9304bab8de20"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Fantasy Cities&lt;/strong&gt; issue adds a beautiful and very easy-to-use city style to CC3+’s repertoire.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Fantasy Worlds&lt;/strong&gt;, map designer Pär Lindström makes his debut and adds a glorious new overland style for your enjoyment.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Sailing Ships&lt;/strong&gt; map pack presents a fully realized 19th century-style sailing ship and the tools to create your own.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol4"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol4"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/157d0f2212e8995c4b8f53737da692a2ec0392ae.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2808f1218596623c3ccd11630e0ba810"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Modern Political&lt;/strong&gt; style lets you create perfectly professional-looking modern maps.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Landform Maps&lt;/strong&gt; issue recreates the amazing hand-drawn look of classic cartographer Erwin Raisz.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Black and White Cities &lt;/strong&gt;is a deceptively simple style that allows you to quickly map detailed city maps.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol5"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol5"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/711b8fe71a29c03feddb9c04c465459c4fce35d2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=31679f48de9a0f826c6b576aafdb89e5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Jon Roberts Overland&lt;/strong&gt; fantasy map style is richly detailed yet subtle.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;1930 Travel Guide &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;1930 Street Maps&lt;/strong&gt; issues provide period-accurate styles for modern horror settings.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;In the &lt;strong&gt;Jon Roberts Dungeon&lt;/strong&gt; style map-maker Jon Roberts applies his subtle art to a gorgeous dungeon style.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol6"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol6"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/78ca7ae0008058e9d56ca8b16b418d0e1d2d15c7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=39ec0c0c1367353a15709f80be6ee77b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Explore dungeons in a whole new perspective with Herwin Wielink’s&lt;strong&gt; Isometric Dungeon&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Jon Roberts completes his trilogy of mapping styles with the &lt;strong&gt;Jon Roberts Cities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Explore a stunning new overland map look with the &lt;strong&gt;Herwin Wielink Overland&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol7"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol7"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c2e637f89d2b3ab3fd0b272cdd57e419302e94e0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d956c2b444fe9abc5377ea5d2ef43fda"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;1930s Overland&lt;/strong&gt; issue adds the missing piece to the puzzle of authentic-looking 1930s styles.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Pär Lindström B&amp;amp;W Overland&lt;/strong&gt; style is a beautiful black &amp;amp; white illustrative style, inspired by (among others) the classic Middle-earth maps of Christopher Tolkien.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;De Rust Overland&lt;/strong&gt; makes use of a gorgeous collection of more than 400 beautiful symbols of mountains, hills, and other natural features.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol8"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol8"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4c230d84639aefe5ba7b059bee9629cf6d9c80be.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1e54cdfaa09b3f127057c2a30e7c899e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The style pack &lt;strong&gt;World War 2 Area Maps&lt;/strong&gt; contains all the templates and tools for you to create area maps for a WW2 setting. It also works nicely for steam or dieselpunk games.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The overland style &lt;strong&gt;Worthington Historical&lt;/strong&gt; is supremely suited to creating overview maps in a historical style.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Quick and easy to use Pär Lindström’s &lt;strong&gt;Modern Journeys&lt;/strong&gt; style lets you whip up gorgeously illustrated maps in minutes. Choose from 150 Symbols to depict your locations, show the travel routes and identify the mode of transportation used.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol9"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol9"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/255d5e2575a5765e6ae38ae682111d2d1deccce5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=46b6171f6d4e37ae22d2ad683cfc9c88"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The extensive overland style &lt;strong&gt;Ancient Realms&lt;/strong&gt; provides plenty of beautiful new symbols along with iconic cartouches for special places and locations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Classic Fantasy &lt;/strong&gt;style goes back to the foundations of the hobby with an overland set inspired by the maps of Professor Tolkien himself.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Deluxe Battle Maps &lt;/strong&gt;pack contains several detail-oriented high-quality battle maps, alongside a tutorial on how to create your own.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol10"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol10"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/36c684ae11c4a64dbf54130f18773748c2564aca.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=279b57e1858b3d8990f8445345d8a9ad"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Naomi VanDoren’s Floorplans&lt;/strong&gt; style contains a great selection of floorplan symbols and bitmap textures to create beautiful and clear overview and battle maps.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Scorching Sun&lt;/strong&gt; overland style consists of many desert and desolation-themed symbols, fill styles and drawing tools, allowing you to create maps of harsh environments, devastated worlds and post-apocalyptic wastelands.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Realms of Legend&lt;/strong&gt; is another classic overland style designed to be supremely versatile and to easily combine with a large variety of other styles.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol11"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol11"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a2c28689e6173b1fdace2cd9ec34027027322658.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f45e38a583f803b6bfaa2541a13b3fda"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Black and White Fantasy&lt;/strong&gt; is a beautiful hand-crafted map style and creates maps that work perfectly as an illustration in a book or as a handout for a fantasy game.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Wild West&lt;/strong&gt; overland style ventures into a new genre with maps to illustrate a historical or imaginary American frontier setting.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Space Galaxy&lt;/strong&gt; explores another frontier, the vast expanses of space, with fantastic maps of galaxies and star clusters.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol12"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol12"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 12&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/da6fac1392aae9b4e48c5e93948f221f5a8937e3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9127211242573a5ee71a2ab945e20cb9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Japanese Temples&lt;/strong&gt; floorplan style recreates the style atmosphere of far-eastern temples and other buildings.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Its companion style &lt;strong&gt;Asian Towns&lt;/strong&gt; zooms out a little to depict matching streets, villages and towns.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Star Charts &lt;/strong&gt;style pack contains all the templates, tools and symbols to depict the night sky and constellations of your fantasy world.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol13"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol13"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 13&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4b913713543fda00a8eced316232c02c6daa1226.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cc4f1361a21e953413b40ae4164b7949"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Worlds of Wonder &lt;/strong&gt;drawing style combines beautiful bitmap textures, quick-drawing vector symbols and easy-to-use tools on one great overland package.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Isometric Town&lt;/strong&gt; style brings the beauty of the isometric perspective to Tudor town maps with easy to use, multiple view house symbols.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ancient Tombs&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Ancient Tombs Isometric&lt;/strong&gt; delve into ancient Egyptian tombs in beautifully matching top-down and isometric styles.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol14"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol14"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/181364a4d6df3e27597681cdf852067c490a331f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f405ddbaef7bd73abe55c42faaf228f9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Spectrum Overland &lt;/strong&gt;drawing style is a full-blown fantasy map style by Sue Daniel introducing her wonderful bitmap artwork into CC3+.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Ryecroft Town&lt;/strong&gt; issue adds a beautiful and very easy to use city style to your arsenal.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inked Dungeons Tombs&lt;/strong&gt; is a beautiful black &amp;amp; white floorplan style for recreating old-school dungeon designs in a gorgeous illustrative style.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol15"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol15"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 15&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cecfa0e371b022382b9da8cbd9424577a5e0e077.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=88b67a2a6930c99d0969595539725b9f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The whimsical &lt;strong&gt;Fantasy Town&lt;/strong&gt; style lets you quickly create small to medium settlements, from hamlets and villages to towns and small cities.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Darklands&lt;/strong&gt; drawing style is another full-blown fantasy map style, this time diving into the grim and gritty themes of fantasy.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Darklands City&lt;/strong&gt; delivers a city style in the same vein and beauty, with its dark tone and many ruined structures.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol16"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol16"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 16&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/67d77fa077466a5e5118601dc453e9104d76caac.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cb91a1c661795003403c371d1a7cec45"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Winter Village&lt;/strong&gt; features wonderful textures and symbols which evoke the spirit of winter and its icy grasp on a settlement.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;In contrast &lt;strong&gt;Forest Trail&lt;/strong&gt; showcases the lush vegetation of a green summer or colorful autumn woodland.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creepy Crypts&lt;/strong&gt; is a sinisterl dungeon style focused on crypts and tombs, including many highly-detailed, beautiful bitmap symbols.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="cartographersannualvol17"&gt;&lt;a id="cartographersannualvol17"&gt;Cartographer's Annual Vol 17&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d9268d1d8c0fb63543eed05ef1454c9893e11d97.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b8cb01155e88843236fa09dbd16f8ad6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take advantage of 17 years of mapping content and creativity!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each Cartographer's Annual gives you thirteen mini add-ons to CC3+, including new drawing styles, symbols sets, map collections, map making tools. Each issue is accompanied by a detailed mapping guide and tutorial that explains how to best use the content.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This volume’s top three:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Desert Oasis&lt;/strong&gt; style lets you create settlements and sites centered around those places of life within the scorched desert, the lush and green oases.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Winter Trails &lt;/strong&gt;leads you into the silent stillness of a wintry forest, with only the crunch of snow and ice underfoot breaking the license.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;E Prybylski Watercolor&lt;/strong&gt; style is an exquisite hand-drawn, watercolour-look overland style.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
