th alien energy waiting to be syphoned by an able mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Crystal (medium size) Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crystal2"&gt;&lt;a id="crystal2"&gt;Crystal 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9ba5bbec83db3271ce0178014b6f405562c870f2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9736cb54bc2f5e25c2dc25f0dad603ba"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suffused with alien energy waiting to be syphoned by an able mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Crystal (large size) Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crystal3"&gt;&lt;a id="crystal3"&gt;Crystal 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6b49338b1a01fb5db8870e3f7dc1412ffe162684.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5cbc777da4cb7b7ba3218ce1f626263f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suffused with alien energy waiting to be syphoned by an able mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Crystal (large size) Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="eldritchaltar"&gt;&lt;a id="eldritchaltar"&gt;Eldritch Altar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0489adde9396affa6f1cca69386825680947aa50.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b0343bd0af09b385dae07c30b39b0cd0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Covered with the blood of its tortured victims, the altar is an example of an eldritch anchor, a beacon for the approaching eldritch swarm.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Eldritch Altar Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="obelisk1"&gt;&lt;a id="obelisk1"&gt;Obelisk 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b676e84c5bdc955aceabf7755d6d5e9812912931.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=80c9840e785e01cc7ed9969fd66c03ef"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Runes in an alien script run across the faintly humming surface of this giant obsidian obelisks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Obelisk Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="obelisk2"&gt;&lt;a id="obelisk2"&gt;Obelisk 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2a40b63c0462c53956342ff10bad33e3a62163b4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1d135dbbdb0efd89e5ccc108ae2cef93"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Runes in an alien script run across the faintly humming surface of this giant obsidian obelisks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Obelisk Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="floatingcrystal"&gt;&lt;a id="floatingcrystal"&gt;Floating Crystal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5082d187f5b6d1912d3aa0a32a3154cc5abf40b5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=eda80401cca523e37ce201aff5247927"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Held afloat by its stored magical energies, the blast the crystal would release when shattered would be a site to behold.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Floating Crystal Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="geyser1"&gt;&lt;a id="geyser1"&gt;Geyser 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5c028821ca0a724e96f2a3d88e8f70e96f77d4b5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cd40e6bf00ca792f27c2a92ff24f75e1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gathering in large colonies, plumphs are highly empathic creatures, able to sense a stranger's intention from a safe distance. Their floating tentacles have healing properties and plumphs are said to have saved lost adventures many a time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Plumph (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 25mm Bases&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="geyser2"&gt;&lt;a id="geyser2"&gt;Geyser 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/07d9c735684427e0c07e98efd5a90f08ef7a4052.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5074794567cfcd5d53a062b465b3c85d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Toxic fumes, coughed up from the bowels of the earth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Geyser Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="geyser3"&gt;&lt;a id="geyser3"&gt;Geyser 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/54ad4beb69f29c86aa2682d9f39c2733bdc12e96.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4759ac0bc58fa737e3ad656a1ef79192"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Toxic fumes, coughed up from the bowels of the earth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Geyser Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="nightmarepot1"&gt;&lt;a id="nightmarepot1"&gt;Nightmare Pot 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/12721111d06986a78ee6c27ec0cd48a5be343fb3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=081f961af7789bd7f6806cf4aaa1ca05"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hundreds of these pods grow in hidden places, waiting for the sign to hatch their nightmarish content into an unsuspecting world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Nightmare Pod Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="nightmarepot2"&gt;&lt;a id="nightmarepot2"&gt;Nightmare Pot 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1618496657b306a552fd78b2096831514f9347de.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=04775e5fcdb4a0271c8950582bd0edda"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hundreds of these pods grow in hidden places, waiting for the sign to hatch their nightmarish content into an unsuspecting world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Nightmare Pod Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="spawningpit1"&gt;&lt;a id="spawningpit1"&gt;Spawning Pit 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/107c7eeab1f0e324e6b17ebf075e98ca9b55ff83.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1cadbd573d0803dd5ed93f4441069a42"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The planet has been warped to spawn the very creatures that will consume it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Spawning Pit Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="spawningpit2"&gt;&lt;a id="spawningpit2"&gt;Spawning Pit 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/41774910d1cd317f5e2541c6d8a0fb184185bbbf.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0281c6ca33d9938a4c03dd4b617cd191"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The planet has been warped to spawn the very creatures that will consume it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Spawning Pit Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voidformingnode1"&gt;&lt;a id="voidformingnode1"&gt;Voidforming Node 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4e2ef15e0724d57bed871a9b4a369d9503da6186.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c073b48c574d938f5dd53b922d2ff077"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Psionic Energies Suffuse these unnatural growths, serving as catalysts for the swarm’s alien psychic powers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Voidform Node Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voidformingnode2"&gt;&lt;a id="voidformingnode2"&gt;Voidforming Node 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/882622507d0a906c474c19d7b486df0522ee5d99.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=02f1b2c21919f6762f6277e392ed3b8f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Psionic Energies suffuse these unnatural growths, serving as catalysts for the swarm’s alien psychic powers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Voidform Node Terrain Piece&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="astralvoyage_5eadventure"&gt;&lt;a id="astralvoyage_5eadventure" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/astralvoyage_5eadventure_preview.pdf?t=st=1794050909~exp=1794137309~hmac=b727b981d28117abd8f5ca21a2322c2a1ed7fbcb0df70219a7bedd2f45ab202e"&gt;Astral Voyage - 5e Adventure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/555144290f3a6f4cbcd58d1b8920a09e5d414a8a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c477bdcce03f1bb22ff5e46168dfc2bc"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Playtested 5e Space Adventure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lost in the vastness of the Astral Sea, the characters are adrift with no memory of how or why they left the material realm. With no clear way home and surrounded&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;on all sides by beings of eldritch evil, they have only one option if they wish to survive this hostile environment – to embark on a perilous Astral Voyage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;5e Adventure PDF&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;High Quality Battlemaps.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;VTT Tokens &amp;amp; Paper Minis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Monster Lore &amp;amp; Statblocks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;!Assets via QR code/link inside PDF!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;FoundryVTT included&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voidstalkers_5eadventure"&gt;&lt;a id="voidstalkers_5eadventure" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/archilectdatasheetandstatblock_preview.pdf?t=st=1794050909~exp=1794137309~hmac=9e75fb74303219f9c3d954433452ab5ed6ae674c4ee53de37393052e1013c3ec"&gt;Void Stalkers - 5e Adventure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ffd6aaecf1073e3d04659c80f4857befbbec2aff.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=552f7b9428bda7c1d155e06530965102"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Playtested&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;"Lost amidst the planes, the characters find themselves strangers in a strange land; a dying celestial hurling them worlds away from home. They have become entangled in a deadly pursuit from plane to plane, and the eldritch evils that have caught their scent are never far behind. They must gather their wits and race against time to escape the clutches of the Void Stalkers."&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This object includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;29 Adventure PDF&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Paper Minis&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Battle Maps&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;VTT Tokens&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;!Assets via QR code/link inside PDF!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;FoundryVTT Ready&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="thought-eaterallianceexpansiondatasheets"&gt;&lt;a id="thought-eaterallianceexpansiondatasheets" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/thought-eaterallianceexpansiondatasheets_preview.pdf?t=st=1794050909~exp=1794137309~hmac=dfd215d7e353df66f94787feab8a0de31321e941e57d3b2229aecc3db81a309c"&gt;Thought-Eater Alliance Expansion Data Sheets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0ab27fc889e462075a128b2f6c0733301e4eb12c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a30aa621f73c5235d46332f6cad4889e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Playtested&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The relationship between the Thought-Eaters and the Void-born yssoloth is not entirely clear. The Thought-Eaters, though without vocal language, carve psychoactive symbols and altars in devotion to something. Thought-Eaters can sometimes be seen among large-scale yssoloth invasions, scavenging materials and knowledge for themselves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;16 page PDF&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One Page Rules Data Sheet for all Thought-Eater Alliance miniatures&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wargear Upgrades&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Army Specific Rules&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thought-Eater Spells&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voidspawngargantua"&gt;&lt;a id="voidspawngargantua"&gt;Voidspawn Gargantua&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ac0d8bad00cf721bd82d573250692d443d393603.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1e46e649baf9290187d3dd8c88660198"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The beast is massive, its serrated, toothy maw easily large enough to swallow a man whole. Its vaguely wormlike shape seems to twist and flow, flesh contorting across its body, constantly reshaping.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Voidspawn Gargantua (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 100mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voidspawn1"&gt;&lt;a id="voidspawn1"&gt;Void Spawn 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3f28e6bba62158bb11efc952c8a052d022578511.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4dca1c27e5b109254d07d26cfc6136a0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Voidspawn are creatures born from the nightmare realm between planes. Without true shape or substance, these foul aberrations are in constant flux, and hunger for powerful sources of energy to consume.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Void Spawn (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 50mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voidspawn2"&gt;&lt;a id="voidspawn2"&gt;Void Spawn 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/66054923e96b26a04e21295aa0e2bb88c53dc837.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a0f1fc75f7ba3f2e6ba59a83bb194476"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Voidspawn are creatures born from the nightmare realm between planes. Without true shape or substance, these foul aberrations are in constant flux, and hunger for powerful sources of energy to consume.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Void Spawn (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 50mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="voidspawn3"&gt;&lt;a id="voidspawn3"&gt;Void Spawn 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1a26437dd1d8463d76ed1051f961ae49579e39c5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f3fe57e0822b201c9140e6b493f3a309"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Voidspawn are creatures born from the nightmare realm between planes. Without true shape or substance, these foul aberrations are in constant flux, and hunger for powerful sources of energy to consume.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Void Spawn (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 50mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="thought-eater1"&gt;&lt;a id="thought-eater1"&gt;Thought-Eater 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bbc41167714d230631342d32ced99fa933baf017.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=84ad5de786b510ea2290c9a2cc164b73"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What they have endured in the dark between realms will perhaps never be known to mortals – and perhaps that is a mercy. But they and their descendants were changed beyond recognition, mutating into beings of horrific eldritch power.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Thought-Eater (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="thought-eater2"&gt;&lt;a id="thought-eater2"&gt;Thought-Eater 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/59a3f544d6f4032d689dbeb97fceaf48b8d0fa82.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dde1ebc439bd6f855b8d848bc8e8917b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What they have endured in the dark between realms will perhaps never be known to mortals – and perhaps that is a mercy. But they and their descendants were changed beyond recognition, mutating into beings of horrific eldritch power.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Thought-Eater (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="thought-eater3"&gt;&lt;a id="thought-eater3"&gt;Thought-Eater 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/47b6d253a84a4502e23c8d2ca69e41dbb27eef7c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2fe96052a8ed775a52ef592532da0d2b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What they have endured in the dark between realms will perhaps never be known to mortals – and perhaps that is a mercy. But they and their descendants were changed beyond recognition, mutating into beings of horrific eldritch power.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Thought-Eater (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="goonloon1"&gt;&lt;a id="goonloon1"&gt;Goon Loon 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5659737bd2cfe4e14be3ca1144fcc6048251c3c7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6db2416b9dbfe88463ae00e2ec582bb8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Walking bombs that were bioengineered to autonomously identify an opposing force’s weekpoints before terminating themselves and anything in their vicinity.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;1 Goon Loon (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="goonloon2"&gt;&lt;a id="goonloon2"&gt;Goon Loon 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/eb2f2221aaf76deaed7d70c0b2afe2a21d73f6f3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0347152e0ec71e89ed264cd4a55652cb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Walking bombs that were bioengineered to autonomously identify an opposing force’s weekpoints before terminating themselves and anything in their vicinity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Goon Loon (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="solarix_bundle"&gt;&lt;a id="solarix_bundle"&gt;Solarix&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bebe92f836dcbfdc0135b7e26ec1cca649905907.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b2678a37c954802da3baeb615678ab90"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The solarix are divine lightbearers, tasked with maintaining and energizing the borders between worlds, preventing reality from collapsing back into the miasma of darkness from whence it came.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Solarix (Celestial) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 75mm Custom Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rubix"&gt;&lt;a id="rubix"&gt;Rubix&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3752655677b0e083f3a57ee009196841d0aa10d2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9ff011f8fe9c0d90dc3fa519d19d60d1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The air shimmers around the creature, its semi-translucent flesh glistening darkly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Rubix (Ooze) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Custom 50mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="plumph"&gt;&lt;a id="plumph"&gt;Plumph&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f1e12794896a2e58d021c2388a70cacc8e3bc425.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7c82134ac03a5e2d4c45934249cf1855"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This object includes:&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;-&amp;nbsp;1&amp;nbsp;Plumph 32mm Scale&lt;br&gt;- 1 Custom Base - 25mm&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tyranplesopliusvii"&gt;&lt;a id="tyranplesopliusvii"&gt;Tyran Plesoplius VII&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/429d594bbe8062d6f845e99e7f9358fbc4997253.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=12e173c69abd7a4f620efc41d3e05472"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tyran Plesoplius is heir to the prominent and wealthy House Plesoplius, one of the ruling families that preside over Silverspear.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Tyran Plesoplius VII (Humanoid) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 25mm Bases&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vanisar"&gt;&lt;a id="vanisar"&gt;Vanisar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/43ad409a9d9e4873e95bdddadbe6be7b02c55c4f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=805698a42a24317c36e8dfcd757f896e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Before you stands a tall, broad- shouldered man with hawkish features and bright blue eyes that flash like distant lightning. He wears flowing blue and grey robes that flutter strangely&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Vanisar (Humanoid) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gythadept1"&gt;&lt;a id="gythadept1"&gt;Gyth Adept 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8af1dc33719383d3dc820fb78900ce1f945095a5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4275a87a8e83fac3959f0071df88ece0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;These gyth forsake many of the piratical glories that their species is famously fond of, instead moving in small, tightly-knit groups of psionic assassins.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes: 1 Gyth Adept (Humanoid) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature. 1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gythadept2"&gt;&lt;a id="gythadept2"&gt;Gyth Adept 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/dc1a196761f8c53c906352215a56eef7939ebe63.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=936e78e2a2c51cca98eb740326b022e5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;These gyth forsake many of the piratical glories that their species is famously fond of, instead moving in small, tightly-knit groups of psionic assassins.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes: 1 Gyth Adept (Humanoid) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature. 1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gythadept3"&gt;&lt;a id="gythadept3"&gt;Gyth Adept 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b3c42e9a5daa20159bc97a10105d6cc7fa7ed679.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=639309eb68b75eac43ea7da3ade597c4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;These gyth forsake many of the piratical glories that their species is famously fond of, instead moving in small, tightly-knit groups of psionic assassins.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes: 1 Gyth Adept (Humanoid) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature. 1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gythcorsair1"&gt;&lt;a id="gythcorsair1"&gt;Gyth Corsair 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/526e3384f1d7ce0a4271f24c9e46061f49a7de5e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=adcb7955f3295ac1811b0812bb4b2011"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Such gyth tend to exalt swordplay, forging blades of psionically charged silver, and are often seen dripping with mismatched trophies plundered from across the Astral Sea.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes: 1 Gyth Corsair (Humanoid) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature. 1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gythcorsair2"&gt;&lt;a id="gythcorsair2"&gt;Gyth Corsair 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cc50203b2001e84da589a53c33aa20afc3bb553d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1353931e5a3b4121124e12294abff4b8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Such gyth tend to exalt swordplay, forging blades of psionically charged silver, and are often seen dripping with mismatched trophies plundered from across the Astral Sea.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes: 1 Gyth Corsair (Humanoid) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature. 1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gythcorsair3"&gt;&lt;a id="gythcorsair3"&gt;Gyth Corsair 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7749f617dd8ca621e76527cd6bedb0d8c168d0ac.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=50f213d1f310b04f580c89a6f81d73cb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Such gyth tend to exalt swordplay, forging blades of psionically charged silver, and are often seen dripping with mismatched trophies plundered from across the Astral Sea.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes: 1 Gyth Corsair (Humanoid) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature. 1 Custom 25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="thunderpeakcyclops"&gt;&lt;a id="thunderpeakcyclops"&gt;Thunderpeak Cyclops&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/39cfa453db1d379f8d1f407a676b354ca7fb5e5b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=28fce1b4358e36696ed8c39d6a8a2d73"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Many times the height of a man, the gigantic monster’s body is laced with muscle and studded with growths of dark, slate grey stone.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Thunderpeak Cyclops (Giant) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 75mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ancientoverseer"&gt;&lt;a id="ancientoverseer"&gt;Ancient Overseer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/835ca9d956481cb93fdde20d9850d3806a0b4ec2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c533f96d334af35a4c83abbabfa10683"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Spawned from the nightmares of the void, ancient overseers guard those dark places of which even the knowledge of their existence can spell doom to a mortal soul.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Ancient Overseer (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Custom 50mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ancientnothic"&gt;&lt;a id="ancientnothic"&gt;Ancient Nothic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f3f24c2a9ec8b70041c3581f372cbc22b71c5f1e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c4f7d66856f8dd20540771d3642f8c3a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Its eye sees across all planes of existence and nothing can escape its voracious gaze. The tremendous knowledge it has hoarded over its long life has turned it into a disturbed and unpredictable creature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;includes:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1 Ancient Nothic (Aberration) - 35mm scale 5e &amp;amp; wargaming STL miniature.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;25mm Base&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="devourerbeast1"&gt;&lt;a id="devourerbeast1"&gt;Devourer Beast 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9a38c62a353e2e3413de321542a21fa7f58eb39e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e4454fc58fff66657d28575164ac91c8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;100% Presupported &amp;amp; Test Printed&lt;/p&