ary Barriers Pack with 28 Unique Meshes. This pack includes all showcased assets, high-quality assets with a good level of detail, and assets optimized for game-ready Projects. If you want to populate your game environments or any Virtual Production levels, here is the pack you can use to get high-quality visuals and well-optimized assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ancientgreekpotterypack_cosmoseclipsegamedevassetstoolsbundle"&gt;&lt;a id="ancientgreekpotterypack_cosmoseclipsegamedevassetstoolsbundle"&gt;Ancient Greek Pottery Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4c121bfe195b73e831bb7f6c9dee25a1a7a96861.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=84125d45c1dee5b09f848372c33c0e1a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;9 AAA-quality Ancient Greek pottery assets featuring authentic historical designs and realistic PBR materials. This pack includes 9 highly detailed and optimized pottery assets, perfect for ancient environments, historical scenes, virtual production, cinematics, and ArchViz projects. Bring the beauty of Classical Antiquity to your projects with the Ancient Greek Pottery Pack. This collection features a carefully crafted set of authentic Greek ceramic vessels inspired by historical pottery styles and traditional red-figure and black-figure artworks. Every asset is provided in both Nanite and standard mesh formats, offering maximum flexibility for next-generation and traditional real-time workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sfxmobilegame"&gt;&lt;a id="sfxmobilegame"&gt;SFX Mobile Game&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0da70dea6883ea66021c01566959b70c53eba781.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1d997248752546524481a3c8dd82dda2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Mobile Game Themed Sound Effect Pack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vfxsmokeunrealengine_leartes"&gt;&lt;a id="vfxsmokeunrealengine_leartes"&gt;VFX Smoke (Unreal Engine)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9bd53516b00fe0c4f26351bee97c628e558cfd21.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=512311ee78dc65005f4b67053680c044"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Leartes Presents Awesome VFX Pack: Unreal Engine Version: 5.0 The Smoke VFX Packs include: -Fog -SmokeChimney -SmokeToxic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="middleeasterntowngigapack"&gt;&lt;a id="middleeasterntowngigapack" href="https://youtu.be/ky3amfy4xn8"&gt;Middle Eastern Town Gigapack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;After months of development, we proudly present MET, Middle Eastern Town Gigapack, inspired by the legendary Round City of Baghdad (Madīnat as-Salām), one of the most iconic urban designs in human history. This pack represents a deep dive into the heart of an ancient desert city inspired by Middle Eastern architecture, with 1000+ meshes, handcrafted modular buildings, props, marketplaces, and procedural foliage systems that bring the atmosphere to life. Reimagined through the lens of architectural heritage and modern environment artistry, MET brings to life the soul of the 8th-century Abbasid Empire: domes, courtyards, bazaars, and palaces surrounded by water channels, gardens, and sand-colored city walls. Includes: A vast open-world map inspired by the 800 AD Abbasid Round City of Baghdad; 1000+ modular meshes for palaces, mosques, bazaars, houses, and props; Procedural foliage for city foliage, palm trees, water gardens, and palace courtyards; Male and Female Character Clothes, Camel with rig, Crocodile, and MetaHuman character support for 5.6 and above; 80+ packed blueprint houses, bridges, courtyards, and decorative elements; Detailed ornaments, carpets, pottery, and decorative assets; Compatible with Ultimate Level Art Tool (ULAT); Nanite and Lumen ready for Unreal Engine 5. Note: The project uses MetaHuman, but the package does not include any characters. It only includes the MetaHuman clothing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="demonicvillageenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="demonicvillageenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/442lz5ye5V0"&gt;Demonic Village Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The darkness is alive with the haunting echoes of restless souls, the cemetery a twisted labyrinth of forgotten souls. It was a timeless and haunting landscape where ghostly whispers danced between crumbling headstones and cursed souls wandered in eternal agony. As the first rays of dawn crept over the horizon, the shadows shifted and merged with the creeping mist, transforming the village into an ever deepening enigma, forever shrouded in mystery and horror. Demonic Village Environment with 237 Unique Meshes. Including all showcased assets, and high-quality assets. With a good level of detail and optimized for Game Ready Projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="neotokyoenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="neotokyoenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/y0wpMqOHsh4"&gt;Neo Tokyo Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Neo Tokyo: Exponential Reality Artstation Challenge 1st Place in the Environment category. 'Neo Tokyo' Environment featuring 465 unique meshes. This comprehensive package includes showcased and high-quality assets, designed with detailed precision and optimized for game-ready projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="modularstylizedvillage"&gt;&lt;a id="modularstylizedvillage" href="https://youtu.be/KIOmQzP4X4U"&gt;Modular Stylized Village&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Modular Stylized Village is a high-quality, modular asset pack including a wide variety of easy-to-assemble modular building assets and high quality props. You can quickly iterate between mesh and material variations to populate and polish your game environment. Showcased example day and night maps are included in the project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="merlinscaveenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="merlinscaveenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/6CbiIoDyC7M"&gt;Merlin`s Cave Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Merlin`s Cave, Dungeon Environment made by amazing Artist Lea Kronenberger Based on the concept of Jeremy Paillotin . Now you can get this Environment in Marketplace by collaboration with our studio. We are happy to publish this Environment with developers, it includes 135 unique meshes and easy to use blueprints / assets and more, such as world aligned materials for most assets so you will get unique results in your levels easily, meshes are well optimized and can blend to each other, you can create small interior or big exterior level with this pack, great product to use in your levels with cave / dungeon concepts&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="colonialconventchurchenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="colonialconventchurchenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/t-sV3TrzF7U"&gt;Colonial Convent Church Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Colonial Convent Church Environment with 116 Unique Meshes. Including all showcased assets, and high-quality assets. With a good level of detail and optimized for Game Ready Projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="crystalsandcraftingenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="crystalsandcraftingenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/7fLQbGhCi3A"&gt;Crystals and Crafting Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Crystals and Crafting Environment with 161 Unique Meshes. Including all showcased assets, and high-quality assets. With a good level of detail and optimized for Game Ready Projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dwarvendungeonsenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="dwarvendungeonsenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/x7yqeNEOETo"&gt;Dwarven Dungeon Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dwarven Dungeon Environment with 102 Unique Meshes. Including all showcased assets, and high-quality assets. Wi