showcased assets, high-quality assets. With a good level of detail and optimized for Gameready Projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="victorianinterior"&gt;&lt;a id="victorianinterior"&gt;Victorian Interior&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/88d850fbd1e1f3e37c646341765f81158dfd9abd.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e956d9f66ffac02bbf989ddca7270993"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Victorian Interior Environment with 78 Assets to populate your Victorian Interior Environments . There are a lot of different type of Assets to help you create or polish your Environments . All Assets made with unique concepts and Showcased Example level is also included in Project . It includes both Daytime and Nighttime Maps , Project Includes 3 Maps in total.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gothiccathedral"&gt;&lt;a id="gothiccathedral"&gt;Gothic Cathedral&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bfb1791d00c1b9e5497ab939ac79df1565cd01a3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5736ecc15c427c8902a6e19f16fd62ba"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enter a realm of forgotten grandeur and somber beauty. Everything you need to create beautiful, atmospheric Gothic cathedrals This pack includes imposing stonework of cathedrals, drawing inspiration from the gothic architecture of medieval Europe, including foliage. Ideal for building levels for gothic horror adventures, atmospheric exploration games, dark fantasy role-playing games, or VR experiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="medievalrussianvillage"&gt;&lt;a id="medievalrussianvillage"&gt;Medieval Russian Village&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1f9197f062ec85866e70ff474d3d5b6c112d3568.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=045cfcef68e39309e173db5f2b205e25"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Medieval Russian Village Environment with 184 Unique Meshes. This includes all showcased assets, high-quality assets with a good level of detail, and assets 