nt )&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stylized Modern Island City with 3817 Assets. There are many different types of Assets to help you create or polish your Environments. All Assets made with unique concepts and Showcased Example levels are also included in the Project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="modularpariscitystreet"&gt;&lt;a id="modularpariscitystreet"&gt;Modular Paris City Street&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ed9ba076bda9e3c2edec7393b91731f7d03f18c0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=559a5d913e4082cced869ce21e62572e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Parisian Street Environment with 222 unique meshes. Bring the romance and elegance of the French capital to your project. Designed for versatility, this pack allows you to construct charming, realistic cityscapes using highly detailed, modular exterior walls complete with classic mansard roofs, dormer windows, and wrought iron balconies. Breathe life into your urban scenes with a wealth of prop dense details. This collection includes everything you need to build a bustling, picturesque avenue: a classic corner "Le Bistrot" cafe with vibrant red awnings and outdoor seating, parked bicycles, classic street lamps, modern traffic signs, and seasonal foliage featuring autumn leaves and climbing vines. It even allows you to frame the perfect shot with the iconic Eiffel Tower in the backdrop. Includes Showcased Preassembled Scene Ideal for urban exploration, cinematic sequences, and architectural visualization. The pack comes complete with a pre-assembled showcase scene, utilizing lighting with Lumen to demonstrate how these assets work together to create a cohesive, vibrant, and atmospheric daylight setting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="stylizedancientathens"&gt;&lt;a id="stylizedancientathens" href="https://youtu.be/-w0oUlnAo9w"&gt;Stylized Ancient Athens&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ancient Athens is a high-quality stylize