ode / Driving model. You can turn the camera view while driving the Car. Note: Please enable "ChaosVehiclesPlugin" and "EnhancedInput" Plugins&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sfxmedievalarmorandbodyimpactpack"&gt;&lt;a id="sfxmedievalarmorandbodyimpactpack"&gt;SFX Medieval Armor &amp; Body Impact Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d4421ae21e7cea9673cf486a9f220a2b3607d791.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7f272fd19def7e1f56ba0ba2ebd521d4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Bring your medieval battles to life with this realistic and cinematic sound effects pack focused on armor hits, body impacts, and melee collisions. Designed for games, trailers, and cinematic scenes, this collection captures the weight, texture, and brutality of authentic medieval combat.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="warzonevfxpackunrealengine"&gt;&lt;a id="warzonevfxpackunrealengine"&gt;Warzone VFX Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b79bc5460b73c618a835b5dc4256d9a210e2a3a8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=867f66c6694580a72c43282ade58a9d9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Warzone-themed 6 different visual effects. Including all showcased assets, and high-quality Visual Effects With a good level of detail and optimized for Game Ready Projects. If you want to populate your game environments or any kind of Virtual Production levels here is the pack that you get and use to get high-quality visuals and well-optimized assets. Unreal Engine Version: 5.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fxexplosionunrealengine_leartes"&gt;&lt;a id="fxexplosionunrealengine_leartes"&gt;VFX Explosion (Unreal Engine)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/28e2b88177ee43b04283dfe1042ca88a6e1eebe1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=79cd33cf047e21fd464600fb53d06af8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Game-ready custom Explosions for your Unreal Engine Games Unreal Engine Version: 5.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
