      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/81010df3d7f1def50d48360974e49d74707eb991.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=e4769560367692cee2e296fb38c3114b"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e6a10ff6be684c35f2bdc6abc467741b3d19dbee.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=f40e03596c5d7ad69a821fda64d2128b"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Elevate your creations with amazing art tools!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Now’s your last chance to unlock professional creative software on your PC with the Create &amp; Elevate Bundle by Corel! Save big on flagship tools like &lt;em&gt;Corel Painter 2023&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;PaintShop Pro 2023&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;VideoStudio Pro 2023&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;AfterShot Pro&lt;/em&gt;, alongside 20 unique brush packs to turn your artistic visions into modern masterpieces. From photo editing and digital painting to cinematic video production, unleash your full creative potential. Pay what you want for pro-grade software and help support Optimist International Youth Programs Foundation with your purchase! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $10 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#aftershotpro3"&gt;AfterShot Pro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#photoportrait"&gt;Photo Portrait&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#1889post-impressionism"&gt;1889 Post-Impressionism&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#videostudiopro2023"&gt;VideoStudio Pro 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#abstract"&gt;Abstract&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#animalspots"&gt;Animal Spots&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#animation"&gt;Animation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#painter2023"&gt;Painter 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#paintshoppro2023"&gt;PaintShop Pro 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#brushpack_boldstrokes"&gt;Bold Strokes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#brushpack_chunkypaint"&gt;Chunky Paint&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#creepers"&gt;Creepers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#desert"&gt;Desert&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#expressive"&gt;Expressive&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fantasy"&gt;Fantasy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#brushpack_love"&gt;Love&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#magical"&gt;Magical&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#brushpack_mosaic"&gt;Mosaic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#brushpack_perfectpets"&gt;Perfect Pets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#rain"&gt;Rain&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#stain"&gt;Stain&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#thickpaintencaustic"&gt;Thick Paint Encaustic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#wedding"&gt;Wedding&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#wizard"&gt;Wizard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $10 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="aftershotpro3"&gt;&lt;a id="aftershotpro3" href="https://youtu.be/IhI43SJB7Dk"&gt;AfterShot Pro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/493bdc6f7ef0a151a18c83c67d71942b5271ff92.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=742529b982617c36f9075983907ba88e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Uncover the pro photographer's secret to time-saving photo editing! It's the photo editor that reveals your true creative potential and frees you: from high costs, from endless subscriptions, from hours spent editing at your computer. Import, process and output faster, and get back behind the camera where you belong with AfterShot™ Pro 3.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="photoportrait"&gt;&lt;a id="photoportrait"&gt;Photo Portrait&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e0181d487a6b73f27c820f8b76702e92fea94e71.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9bc073de6f05b33512c74cc5b30506f7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you're a photographer looking to transform portraits into elegant paintings, this is the perfect pack for you. Give your photos an artistic makeover by painting and blending skin, hair, clothing and backgrounds with the perfect custom brush for any project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="1889post-impressionism"&gt;&lt;a id="1889post-impressionism"&gt;1889 Post-Impressionism&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4ca26213a71037551975e99970e019761635ac7b.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f6f44febf9a8403bc65d97b880d6529d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take a journey back in time and paint like one of the great Masters of art, Vincent van Gogh. All the brushes you need to recreate one of his iconic masterpieces are at your fingertips. Apply texture and create depth with dynamic media types and brushes that will give your subject a post-impressionist effect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt20"&gt;Pay $20 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="videostudiopro2023"&gt;&lt;a id="videostudiopro2023" href="https://youtu.be/vs4WKAKeeTs"&gt;VideoStudio Pro 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5de2c5ccbbcbfd75434fbe161fcb1e9105ef9e6a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9017a69492a8ec43613c47e8d80d7d74"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Turn your best moments and life experiences into unique movies with Corel VideoStudio Pro, an easy and fun video editor packed with intuitive tools and creative effects. From basic trimming tools to custom titles, transitions, and multi-camera editing, the whole palette of handy features has been designed for you to create your best videos yet! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Live life. Make movies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="abstract"&gt;&lt;a id="abstract"&gt;Abstract&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9f3565c4444d5bd5ef1046da5f6b8b66e9e4eec9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5d6ab78b3001c0ef55a649233b136fe7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring any conceptual idea to life with crazy, erratic, spiro or globular brushes that push and pull with wild spirals and infinite possibilities in this Abstract brush pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="animalspots"&gt;&lt;a id="animalspots" href="https://youtu.be/2UJbW87vStg"&gt;Animal Spots&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f08e39c31729bdb37ad2ee07e6eefb7c323d41b3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=aeff2b4dfce3d598455984cf517343e0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Designed to save time rendering, quickly create unique custom animal patterns with this set of spot brushes. From cheetah to fish spots, your animal paintings will come to life with these masterful marks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="animation"&gt;&lt;a id="animation" href="https://youtu.be/YXSqf_YjieM"&gt;Animation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/20a4cd02582ee9bfa0ccf9092efea9b89e190322.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f9851c01a4ce4738fffd3dda845fa40c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dripping, glowing and twinkling brushes dramatically create magic on the canvas before your eyes. The Animation brush pack is complete with customized tools to create a work of art straight from a movie scene, or to build characters with such precision they’ll look like they jumped out of a storybook.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="painter2023"&gt;&lt;a id="painter2023" href="https://youtu.be/IUTG-q-rhzo"&gt;Painter 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/39f2fc9fb399739f4893f782967e360eb756d765.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=10904c881ae1b2abd8c04a206bf81a6e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create your signature style with renowned digital art software. Sketch, paint, illustrate and make unparalleled photo-art with hundreds of realistic artist-created brushes, exclusive media, and an array of artistic tools. With substantial processing strength to easily handle large canvases and powerful media you can confidently paint original works as diverse as your imagination. Find inspiration by sharing custom content with fellow artists and extend your knowledge with a library of free learning resources and live webinars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="paintshoppro2023"&gt;&lt;a id="paintshoppro2023" href="https://youtu.be/5lcS9Pa30HU"&gt;PaintShop Pro 2023&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;For passionate photo enthusiasts who want to make every shot their best shot, PaintShop® Pro is an advanced photo editor delivering a versatile range of pro-level editing and graphic design tools along with time-saving AI-based solutions and incredible flexibility of multiple workspaces. Enrich the visual stories your images tell by using a collection of creative tools to paint, draw, add text, or build composites with layers and masks. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;PaintShop Pro.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real. Intelligent. Creative.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="brushpack_boldstrokes"&gt;&lt;a id="brushpack_boldstrokes" href="https://youtu.be/aia4Vk-ei0I"&gt;Bold Strokes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/82409221b740e1abca7d94c123c671402e5e7b2f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=de817f35af6150f6fcd25c44454f9ae9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are you looking for bold, dynamic brushstrokes to incorporate into your paintings? These brushes take advantage of 2016 technology like Dynamic Speckles, Liquid Ink &amp;amp; Particle mixing that result in splattering, sparkly or swirly strokes that will ignite your creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="brushpack_chunkypaint"&gt;&lt;a id="brushpack_chunkypaint" href="https://youtu.be/AKG46VwHntk"&gt;Chunky Paint&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a54e3484afff41bda757bf419c478e72fe8f2df1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4754c5b03890fd8c4f928d54d8fde9fe"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add just the right texture and thickness to any painting with these large, stocky, and chubby brushes in the Chunky Paint Brush Pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="creepers"&gt;&lt;a id="creepers" href="https://youtu.be/KR6xyo9LApI"&gt;Creepers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2b7cfa8f8c116f6c432327e60028c44e86b51a46.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=841f8dee2e3a713d5e61e2c4955bfee4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Turn photos or illustrations into eerie interpretations by painting cracked skin, bacteria grunge, nasty stitches, mangy fur and aged freckles into a disturbingly realistic environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="desert"&gt;&lt;a id="desert" href="https://youtu.be/mevzloVA9js"&gt;Desert&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a9bb21b7f4c874b05115741f123c30ee1d1a7c02.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b282c10360d9fc550aba32dc3fe89a94"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Paint a scene from the Wild West with realistic prickly cactus, desert shrubs and tumbleweeds blowing across your canvas. This brush pack is loaded with everything you need to create from scratch, or add authentic wear and tear to any painting with these dry and rough brushstrokes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="expressive"&gt;&lt;a id="expressive" href="https://youtu.be/E5BUJX8z-nA"&gt;Expressive&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/198708ae944bf6e31662f2da2d005aebe2a5acd3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=54702667167585bae2a33c02c30b83a2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add a tactile effect to your imagery with luscious, thick and juicy brushes that will bring a palpable energy to your paintings that only award-winning Natural-Media can deliver.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fantasy"&gt;&lt;a id="fantasy" href="https://youtu.be/w4oBmNuX4CM"&gt;Fantasy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/48e2b55f5702caec552447b759446a7bb8c14f75.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f2c1e1b31f30d321de4e454b52d51c90"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Craft the ultimate in fantastical scenes using visionary mythical brushes. Adding magical or angelic effects to your photos and composites has never been easier.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="brushpack_love"&gt;&lt;a id="brushpack_love" href="https://youtu.be/hCH4sQYtGKc"&gt;Love&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;All you need is love to inspire fun and whimsical paintings of hearts, flowers, and more with this new brush pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="magical"&gt;&lt;a id="magical" href="https://youtu.be/_p57afPO5Y4"&gt;Magical&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/20f7bbc47e6e1b5610cedb88fd0c8d4dc7067221.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=10e1b332964e4e2819a7874d624054b0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wave your magic wand and cast a spell over your artistic compositions! Add stars, magic, fairy dust and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="brushpack_mosaic"&gt;&lt;a id="brushpack_mosaic" href="https://youtu.be/XbhxOgTny94"&gt;Mosaic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apply intricate brush marks and colorful patterns to create stunning mosaic designs. The brush pack covers various shapes and textures including glass beads, shards, and tiles to give you diversity in your design work whether you are going for an exotic or simpler styles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="brushpack_perfectpets"&gt;&lt;a id="brushpack_perfectpets" href="https://youtu.be/PX0x7kdkKcg"&gt;Perfect Pets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Paint a lifelike critter, complete with realistic fur and tail, using the Perfect Pets brush pack that has all of your favorite animals in mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rain"&gt;&lt;a id="rain"&gt;Rain&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/145fb52132577921ad527069c3d514cbdd1e24ba.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=88a930561362922bee97f55348a4f41d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience the realistic effects of drenching, drizzling, and storming with these expressive Rain brushes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="stain"&gt;&lt;a id="stain" href="https://youtu.be/LTwcKW3AcjQ"&gt;Stain&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/aee89f5c062c5e2a4691983038a7fd83639f3d9a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f3799de2d7aa9746b5d3b22386af6c08"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make a lasting impression using versatile overlays that mimic realistic stains on your surfaces made possible by these masterfully created brushes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="thickpaintencaustic"&gt;&lt;a id="thickpaintencaustic"&gt;Thick Paint Encaustic&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8174855a1d8354b93d1d39ee0b03fce5e1baf9d8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=78e707d72009396c6dbbf1aa42413924"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Thick Paint Encaustic Brush Pack by Dena Steinberg will allow you to add rich texture and volume to any painting. The deposits of wax are incredibly realistic and organic allowing your brush to dance and weave with joy. This pack will also work really well with the Artisan Encaustic Brush Pack that will play off the thick paint texture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="wedding"&gt;&lt;a id="wedding" href="https://youtu.be/m5qcJPFUWyw"&gt;Wedding&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/14e72b3f96ed2e5fec547f0505127af4e9cd665d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=dc372280a9a37e4be3c173685aceb6c3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;You've captured the priceless wedding portraits, now create unique memory composites that will surprise and delight the happy couple. Explore chic brushes to fine-tune the bride and groom or embellish the environment with light flares, bubbles, snow, glitter, love letters and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="wizard"&gt;&lt;a id="wizard" href="https://youtu.be/gVZkWkzLqU0"&gt;Wizard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/be199c38ee4d7a3a3e84a904d2775e7b20276d20.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9b147d123f547900286c7b2075417ccb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wield your magical brush powers and cast a spell over your composites. Transform scenes with twinkling sparkles, boiling cauldrons, mysterious spirits, sprites, zings and zaps.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
