ot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Set up Claude Code with a Godot project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Prompt for plane movement, shooting and enemies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build a 3D top-down view for the game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Review and adjust what Claude Code generates.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn a workflow you can reuse on your own game ideas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source code included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enroll today!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="builda3dtaptostackgodotgamewithcodex"&gt;&lt;a id="builda3dtaptostackgodotgamewithcodex"&gt;Build a 3D Tap to Stack Godot Game with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/606ee2827914296e4ff4524a8575b30448754f09.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a15507779f5916418e7073b69710ac56"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tap at the right moment, stack the block, and keep the tower growing. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this video course, you’ll use Codex to build a 3D tap-to-stack game in Godot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Prompt Codex to generate and revise Godot game code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build the tap-to-stack mechanic in 3D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Test and adjust gameplay through follow-up prompts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source code included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stack the odds in your favor. Get it while it’s here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="builda3dterrainsurvivalgodotgameinclaudecodeandblendermodelsinc"&gt;&lt;a id="builda3dterrainsurvivalgodotgameinclaudecodeandblendermodelsinc"&gt;Build a 3D Terrain Survival Godot Game in Claude Code and Blender Models in Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2f98f1177f4a59f2665b97013e2b8395fc926c8e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d4dc0a2fe6113157273ae1020cc961f9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A character that slows down on hills, leaves footprints, and runs from enemies. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll build the game in Godot with Claude Code, then create its 3D character in Codex.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generate hilly terrain, slope-based WASD movement, and lighting options you can switch between.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build a walking player from primitives, with knee joints and footprints that follow its path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Add enemies with idle, walk and chase states, a danger zone, and a game over screen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generate, rig and animate a 3D character in Codex, then modify it into new enemy models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Split the work between 2 AI tools in this video course and learn where each one fits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source code included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Limited spots!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="createa3dworldbuildinggodotgamewithcodexandblendermcp"&gt;&lt;a id="createa3dworldbuildinggodotgamewithcodexandblendermcp"&gt;Create a 3D World Building Godot Game with Codex and Blender MCP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a7d6000319cad461a63349a7dd2f601946ddccd0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=71f7a62d5ec0fea74a9d30afe0b5bd83"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build the world first, then let the player loose in it. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to use Codex with the Blender MCP to create 3D assets and bring them into a Godot world-building game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connect Codex to Blender through MCP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generate 3D models for a game world.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Bring your assets into Godot and build the game around them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Follow along in this video course and see a game world come together from prompts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source code included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your world won’t build itself. Jump in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="introtocodex"&gt;&lt;a id="introtocodex"&gt;Intro to Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/292e3ac38b434ae0004a10d4e43320079c200fe8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=093feefb11b80f4d0186188c9ae39fcb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Codex reads code, and it also handles spreadsheets, slide decks and messy folders. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn what Codex is, install it, and put it to work in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Explore an existing repository and update projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Start a new project from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Run browser tasks and analyze Excel data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Create PowerPoints, convert files, organize folders and process images.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use Codex for your coding work and the everyday tasks around it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source code included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stop doing it by hand. Get Codex working for you now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildtwitch-controlledgodotgamesfirst-timeexclusivehumblebundlerel"&gt;&lt;a id="buildtwitch-controlledgodotgamesfirst-timeexclusivehumblebundlerel"&gt;Build Twitch-Controlled Godot Games&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5d36337203782d98baebbe1ec48a8826373a4f10.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6b4b51ef41bcea18e02081290c501c2f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let chat play the game. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this video course, Alex Kropf shows you how to connect Godot games to a Twitch channel so viewers control the action.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Set up an app in the Twitch Developers Console and create a user access token.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connect a Godot game to a broadcaster’s chat.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Add a username input or detect the logged-in streamer automatically with OAuth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build a boss battle and an army battle where chat picks sides.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give your stream something viewers can do besides watch.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your chat is waiting. Go live sooner.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="builda3dmultiplayernpc-to-npcsimulatorwithollamaingodot"&gt;&lt;a id="builda3dmultiplayernpc-to-npcsimulatorwithollamaingodot"&gt;Build a 3D Multiplayer NPC-to-NPC Simulator with Ollama in Godot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/75e6d0eefe44f1e74fbc67c3667e83bff9bbd3ca.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7a439d64572ff2e355c057046e5a357e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;2 NPCs talk to each other while viewers suggest topics and hear the conversation out loud. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The AI model and the voices run on your own machine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Install Ollama and connect it to Godot with HTTPRequest nodes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Write character prompts, add persistent memory, and limit conversation history.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Add local text-to-speech with Kokoro TTS and espeak-ng.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build a FastAPI multiplayer server that broadcasts dialogue and topics to every viewer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Run the manager and viewers from the terminal and watch your NPCs talk in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join the herd.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildgamesandbrandedaugmentedrealityintiktokeffecthousewithcodexfi"&gt;&lt;a id="buildgamesandbrandedaugmentedrealityintiktokeffecthousewithcodexfi"&gt;Build Games and Branded Augmented Reality in TikTok Effect House with Codex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a3a5aef5005acc9dcccc4993b40ead1fafb7d464.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=41b0b7a79fe24a19168166edf701d3f4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Try on a custom t-shirt, tilt your head to steer a game, or point your camera at a logo and watch it react. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to build these TikTok effects in Effect House with Codex in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build your first effects, including an AR logo recognizer with 3D target tracking.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Create a virtual clothing try-on and format a custom t-shirt PNG with an LLM.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generate multi-transformation effects with Codex.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build 2D and 3D filter games, tested with a photorealistic head-tilt player.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make effects for brands, games or your own feed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t wait to publish your first effect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="digitalsculptingbasicswithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehu"&gt;&lt;a id="digitalsculptingbasicswithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehu"&gt;Digital Sculpting Basics with Blender in Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5548325ab56d21fed773bc38385bd677f15b1d12.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=059631458b38b44f85bade4910079e95"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sculpting in Blender usually means hours with a brush. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this video course, you’ll direct Claude Code to handle much of that work while you guide the result.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connect Claude to Blender.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build a base mesh and set up sculpting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Sculpt the model in stages, then texture the eyes and add fur.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Render the finished piece.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn how far prompts can take a sculpt and where your own adjustments matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grab your seat while it’s open.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vehiclemodelingprincipleswithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusiv"&gt;&lt;a id="vehiclemodelingprincipleswithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusiv"&gt;Vehicle Modeling Principles with Blender in Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b86cf9469fb6b4052e784df28ec942dff7d1d8c2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=94e29f96470e47b612b3b1db077c71ea"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A hot air balloon has a curved envelope, a basket, and ropes tying them together. That makes it a good vehicle to learn on. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build one in Blender with Claude Code in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Set up Blender with Claude Code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Model the balloon envelope and block out the gondola.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Add ropes, connections and details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Apply materials and a balloon pattern, then render.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Finish with a review of workflow lessons and a follow-up on the PIL method.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lift off before the spots fill up.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="low-polystylizationwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumbl"&gt;&lt;a id="low-polystylizationwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumbl"&gt;Low-Poly Stylization with Blender in Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/95d934b6dcea6391077d2d09b45657ecb96f5081.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=daab9cdf3fda2262e102305dbd1078e0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Flat colors, few polygons, strong shapes. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to build stylized low-poly scenes in Blender with Claude Code in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connect Claude to Blender and create quick first scenes, including a desert.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generate trees, land, a barn and animals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Fill out the scene, then make manual edits where Claude’s output needs your hand.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Render the final scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get a feel for when to prompt and when to edit yourself.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t let this one pass you by.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="riggingandanimationwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumbl"&gt;&lt;a id="riggingandanimationwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumbl"&gt;Rigging and Animation with Blender in Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b4198008edcc921fc9cd07be3a77caa70b37e28d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fc784873494456057417dad51a8871ad"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start with a bouncing ball. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;End with a rigged turkey. In between, animate cans and a shoe ad, all with Claude Code driving Blender.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connect Claude to Blender.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Animate a bouncing ball and 2 can scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Produce an animated shoe ad.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Rig and animate a turkey.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Follow along in this video course using the included blend files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get moving before you miss it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="primitivemodelingfundamentalsinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumble"&gt;&lt;a id="primitivemodelingfundamentalsinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumble"&gt;Primitive Modeling Fundamentals in Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/789d0f48d2657d36da5fffc90c6e158ac1e3d688.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3147d02184cae0dfddace2c12463658a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A cup, a sword, a tree, a desk setup and a pirate ship. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Each one starts from basic shapes, and Claude does the building through Blender.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connect Claude Desktop to Blender via MCP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Model a cup, a low-poly sword and a tree.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build a low-poly computer desk setup and keep your scene named and organized.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build a detailed pirate ship.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pick up prompting tips along the way, like what to do when Claude doesn’t respond. All in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Claim your spot and start modeling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pbrmaterialauthoringwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumb"&gt;&lt;a id="pbrmaterialauthoringwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumb"&gt;PBR Material Authoring with Blender in Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5c618032c1b273ada89769b2a917470498355a4a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6d1e24bf7871cb78748843a4d746cf5f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A plain model looks unfinished until its materials are right. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to author PBR materials in Blender with Claude Code in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Set up the scene and the model.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► UV unwrap the model.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build primary and secondary textures and blend them in layers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Create a mech material and polish the result.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apply the same process to your own models afterward.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Act now and give your models the finish they need.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="hard-surfacemodelingwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumb"&gt;&lt;a id="hard-surfacemodelingwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumb"&gt;Hard-Surface Modeling with Blender in Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/eda26db33459dcbddf73a5d6dce92519e7b3efd0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d3017a55a01d932da3dc34e656fd3a87"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Clean edges and parts that fit together. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a legged turret in Blender with Claude Code and learn how hard-surface models come together in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Block out the base and legs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Polish the base.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Block out the barrel and turret, then assemble the pivot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Polish the final model.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use the source files to compare your build at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lock in your access now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="aiboxmodelingwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumblebundl"&gt;&lt;a id="aiboxmodelingwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-timeexclusivehumblebundl"&gt;AI Box Modeling with Blender in Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f991eeca0c8ab717dd6806b024f06a90148a1af4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fb6147964b53f615447230287f65e066"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;See what Claude builds from a single prompt. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Then build it properly, one piece at a time, in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Install and set up Claude with Blender.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Lay the foundation, ground floor and road pavement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Create the garden surface, cone trees and hedges.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build, detail and polish the house.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn how breaking a scene into parts gives you more control over the result.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Secure your spot now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="booleanandnon-destructivemodelingwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-time"&gt;&lt;a id="booleanandnon-destructivemodelingwithblenderinclaudecodefirst-time"&gt;Boolean &amp; Non-Destructive Modeling with Blender in Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/31b6ebd8cde07d9a8fe3109c451f200f6b2bea88.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d7ae485f55d6391b8fc91afe08423f5b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gears, a pallet fork and a swinging pendulum. A steampunk clock is full of parts that boolean and non-destructive modeling handle well. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build one with Claude Code in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Model the escape wheel, pallet fork and pendulum, with a spiral array tip.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build clock faces and a gear train with Geometry Nodes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Add materials and shading, and learn when to use hide_viewport vs hide_set.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Rig, animate and render the clock.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The clock is ticking. Start building yours.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gettingstartedwithgodot46_editorandscriptingfoundations"&gt;&lt;a id="gettingstartedwithgodot46_editorandscriptingfoundations"&gt;Getting Started with Godot 4.6: Editor &amp; Scripting Foundations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/3c4aa0ddaeb8009fd8e104d894750c9d1a76b488.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4a26da5fd15976dcf6c937147b244342"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;New to Godot? Learn your way around the editor, then write your first GDScript in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Install Godot and navigate the interface.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Work with scenes, nodes, project settings and assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Attach scripts, follow the script lifecycle, and use @export and @onready.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Write conditions and functions, handle input and movement, and connect buttons with signals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build the base you need before starting your first game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source code included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t put off your first script. Begin now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="godot46gamefundamentalscrashcourse"&gt;&lt;a id="godot46gamefundamentalscrashcourse"&gt;Godot 4.6 Game Fundamentals Crash Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fe02257715ad19d72053ead0e8e8ae9f644fb269.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2f5e62d424b30a82b0899b1907a15b31"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A main menu, a character, falling coins and a score. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a full game loop in Godot 4.6 in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Download Godot and set up your project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Create a main menu UI and make it work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build a map, a moveable character, and coins that spawn faster over time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Detect collisions, show a score, and add game over and restart logic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source code included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get in the game now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="makeaminimalist2dgeometrysurvivalgameingodot46_fromscratch"&gt;&lt;a id="makeaminimalist2dgeometrysurvivalgameingodot46_fromscratch"&gt;Make a Minimalist 2D Geometry Survival Game in Godot 4.6 - From Scratch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8dbf9277dc836a7089ba4e8b7056ac265ce9dd67.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a334716e995c60193412fc4b0f6c8a54"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dodge shrinking circles and rack up points. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to build this minimalist survival game from an empty Godot 4.6 project in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Set up the project and spawn your player with controls and movement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Place polygon vertices to generate circles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Spawn and shrink circles dynamically.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Detect collisions and update the score with signals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source code included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jump in before time runs out.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildagentskillsinclaudecode_automatewithai"&gt;&lt;a id="buildagentskillsinclaudecode_automatewithai"&gt;Build Agent Skills in Claude Code - Automate with AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ae7bf8709627d62cc4b976646df4c76c22ba0e0c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f4ccb854cd3f661f06220d7b3ae183c0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tired of giving Claude Code the same instructions every session? &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Write them once as a skill. Learn how in this video course.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Set up Claude Code and learn how it works.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Build a skill and install .skill files.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Configure skill frontmatter and add extra resources.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Share and deploy your skills.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stop repeating yourself. Sign up now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
