      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d94f66609e3dc9a1674a04ca052d21959dba33b0.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=44d9c0529219230c79dda002a213ef20"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e9b8dd7ba0257a899fe47b6c86305e753fc53b7f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=4cbe57f3e75a0b8ca5ae3323ff47a1bc"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Transform your ideas with Higgsfield&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn how to optimize your production cycle with The Complete Higgsfield AI Video Creation Bundle. Higgsfield replaces your AI stack with one powerful platform to create videos, images, music, and more using 50+ premium models. This curated collection will help you build video games, add polish to your YouTube videos, and much more with specialized learning courses like &lt;em&gt;Build Faceless YouTube Channels with Higgsfield&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Build Game Trailers with Higgsfield AI and DaVinci Resolve&lt;/em&gt;. Learn to leverage the most powerful creation tools and help support Girls Who Code with your purchase! &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys expire. All titles must be redeemed by November 7, 2027. &lt;/span&gt; &lt;iframe width="400" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/7MUwB4kDfNY?si=fqBBD8KfO7Y-pPb7" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#introductionto3dmodelingwithblenderandclaudecode"&gt;Introduction to 3D Modeling with Blender and Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#environmentmodelingwithblenderusingclaudecode"&gt;Environment Modeling with Blender using Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildfacelessyoutubechannelswithhiggsfield"&gt;Build Faceless YouTube Channels with Higgsfield&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildgametrailerswithhiggsfieldaianddavinciresolve"&gt;Build Game Trailers with Higgsfield AI and DaVinci Resolve&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildmotiondesigninclaudecodeandaftereffectswithhiggsfieldmcp"&gt;Build Motion Design in Claude Code and After Effects with Higgsfield MCP &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildandreskina3drollergodotgamewithhiggsfieldblendermcpandcodex"&gt;Build and Reskin a 3D Roller Godot Game with Higgsfield Blender MCP and Codex &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#build3dtiktokeffectswithhiggsfieldblendermcpandeffecthouse"&gt;Build 3D TikTok Effects with Higgsfield Blender MCP and Effect House &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildcommercialsandproductvideoswithhiggsfield"&gt;Build Commercials and Product Videos with Higgsfield &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildhiggsfieldvideoswithcapcut"&gt;Build Higgsfield Videos with CapCut &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildfilmswithhiggsfield"&gt;Build Films with Higgsfield &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildgamestoryprologuewithhiggsfieldai"&gt;Build Game Story Prologue with Higgsfield AI &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildmusicvideoswithhiggsfield"&gt;Build Music Videos with Higgsfield &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#build3dmodelswithhiggsfieldblendermcpforgodot"&gt;Build 3D Models with Higgsfield Blender MCP for Godot &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildmotiondesignwithhiggsfieldaiandgpt6"&gt;Build Motion Design with Higgsfield AI and GPT 6 &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildyoutubethumbnailswithhiggsfield"&gt;Build YouTube Thumbnails with Higgsfield &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildcharacterrevealgamevideoswithhiggsfieldai"&gt;Build Character Reveal Game Videos with Higgsfield AI &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildadswithhiggsfieldmarketingstudioai"&gt;Build Ads with Higgsfield Marketing Studio AI &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#cinematographyandcameramovementwithhiggsfieldcinemastudioai"&gt;Cinematography and Camera Movement with Higgsfield Cinema Studio AI &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#buildcharactersandconsistentvisualswithhiggsfield"&gt;Build Characters and Consistent Visuals with Higgsfield &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#higgsfieldaifundamentals_becomeacreativedirector"&gt;Higgsfield AI Fundamentals - Become a Creative Director &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#generateassetlibrarieswithblenderinclaudecode"&gt;Generate Asset Libraries with Blender in Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="introductionto3dmodelingwithblenderandclaudecode"&gt;&lt;a id="introductionto3dmodelingwithblenderandclaudecode"&gt;Introduction to 3D Modeling with Blender and Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/db909b7ad9d82a74cb0f8bf677ec2f44c368be74.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8a3ceef392833701c2f6640decbf84ff"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;New to Blender? Learn it with Claude Code at your side. This video course covers the basics through 2 small projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll learn core modeling tools, then build and render a treasure chest.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Objects, transforms, and edit mode.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Extrude, loop cuts, and subdivision surfaces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Creating bottle materials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Modeling a treasure chest with materials and a final render.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The fundamentals here carry into every Blender project after this.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&