yours started. Don’t miss out!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="higgsfieldaifundamentals_becomeacreativedirector"&gt;&lt;a id="higgsfieldaifundamentals_becomeacreativedirector"&gt;Higgsfield AI Fundamentals - Become a Creative Director &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/890a6392e0e82cb159267b620922e4d70ba101af.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=98c5ca68a13ff69e2e0d9bf1c44a4813"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Higgsfield does video, images, audio, and apps. This video course covers how to use all of it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll pick the right models, generate across media, and connect Higgsfield to other tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generating video with audio in Cinema Studio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Choosing video and image generation models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Connecting Higgsfield MCP to AI agents, Blender, DaVinci Resolve, Figma, and Adobe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building AI workflows and generating sites and games in Higgsfield Supercomputer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A starting point before any of the project-based Higgsfield courses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Creative direction with AI is a skill people are hiring for. Don't miss out!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="generateassetlibrarieswithblenderinclaudecode"&gt;&lt;a id="generateassetlibrarieswithblenderinclaudecode"&gt;Generate Asset Libraries with Blender in Claude Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7c8840b15b4f4900a881bf70733d169e8eb9bbf5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=239977422af63157015c5dfd951bbda7"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Game environments need reusable parts. This video course generates a sci-fi asset library in Blender, directed through Claude Code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll build panels, assemble a scene, light it, and add detail.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Setting up Blender with Claude Code.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Generating wall and floor panels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Assembling and lighting the scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Building 2 vent grille designs and finishing details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You'll end with a complete scene built from your own asset library.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stop modeling every piece by hand. Start now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
