out Tower&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#abandonedcitybus_drivable"&gt;Abandoned City Bus - Drivable / Replicated&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#modularcontainereditor"&gt;Modular Container Editor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#abandonedsedan_taxiandpoliceandsheriff"&gt;Abandoned Sedan - Taxi / Police / Sheriff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="infernaldestroyer"&gt;&lt;a id="infernaldestroyer" href="https://youtu.be/ml7WGPd8SDI"&gt;Infernal Destroyer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unleash Unstoppable Destruction!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Meet the Infernal Destroyer, a fearsome demonic warrior designed for brutal combat, powerful enemies, and epic dark fantasy encounters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;⚔️ Key Features&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; 3 skin variations: Dark, Fire &amp;amp; Gold&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Infernal Battle Axe&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Customizable morph targets&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; 4K textures and advanced materials&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; ARKit-ready facial animations and Live Link support&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Combat animations and cinematic dissolve effect&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; Create your own terrifying boss fights, elite enemies, or demonic warriors with a character built to command attention.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Featuring a UE5-compatible rig.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to unleash chaos in your game? Bring the Infernal Destroyer to the battlefield!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="purenature_asianvalley"&gt;&lt;a id="purenature_asianvalley" href="https://youtu.be/3-NWnjes7LI"&gt;Pure Nature : Asian Valley&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discover the Beauty of an Asian Valley!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a peaceful yet captivating landscape with Pure Nature : Asian Valley, a stylized environment pack inspired by Asian natural scenery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Key Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; 110+ unique assets&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Stylized Asian valley environment&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Bamboo, riverside scenery, gardens, and rice-themed elements&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Demo map included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Designed for large open-world games&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; Perfect for exploration games, Asian-inspired adventures, fantasy RPGs, and tranquil natural environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Imagine winding rivers, lush bamboo groves, and beautiful valleys waiting to be explored. What kind of adventure will you create in this scenic world?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring a distinctive natural atmosphere to your Unreal Engine project with Pure Nature : Asian Valley!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Check out the trailer and documentation to get started.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="abandonedsuv_policeandsheriffandfirerescue"&gt;&lt;a id="abandonedsuv_policeandsheriffandfirerescue" href="https://youtu.be/Rwz2telFt6Y"&gt;Abandoned SUV - Police / Sheriff / Fire Rescue&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;🚔 Bring Your Abandoned Streets to Life!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Add a versatile SUV to your game with this asset featuring police, sheriff, and fire rescue vehicle themes. Its multiple appearance options make it suitable for abandoned cities, survival environments, and emergency-response scenes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔧 Key Features:&lt;br&gt;• Drivable vehicle with a simple character controller&lt;br&gt;• Clean, worn, mossy, burnt, and destroyed appearances&lt;br&gt;• Openable vehicle parts&lt;br&gt;• Detailed engine and interior&lt;br&gt;• Car randomizer for drivable and static vehicles&lt;br&gt;• Separate glass and LODs&lt;br&gt;• 24 unique meshes&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🎮 Perfect for survival games, post-apocalyptic worlds, emergency-response scenes, and open-world exploration.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔥 Create a deserted city where every vehicle hints at a story. Will your SUV be left behind after an evacuation or discovered during an exploration mission?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h2 id=