eate and customize container layouts through an in-editor UI, giving you the freedom to place walls, doors, and windows wherever you need them.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Key Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Modular container building system&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; UI widget for creating and editing layouts on the fly&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Customizable materials&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Slider for switching between new and aged appearances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Separate window and door blueprints&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; LODs and custom or automatic collision&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; 66 unique meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; Perfect for survival games, industrial environments, cargo facilities, and modular base-building projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Why settle for fixed layouts when you can design your own? Customize your containers and build structures that fit your vision!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="abandonedsedan_taxiandpoliceandsheriff"&gt;&lt;a id="abandonedsedan_taxiandpoliceandsheriff" href="https://youtu.be/IVxKrzK9X7M"&gt;Abandoned Sedan - Taxi / Police / Sheriff&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give Your Abandoned World More Character!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add a versatile sedan to your game with this vehicle asset, featuring taxi, police, and sheriff-themed possibilities. Designed for realistic and post-apocalyptic environments, it supports both drivable gameplay and static vehicle placement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Key Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Drivable vehicle with a simple character controller&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Clean, worn, mossy, burnt, and destroyed appearances&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Openable vehicle parts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Detailed engine and interior&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Car randomizer for drivable and static vehicles&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Separate glass and LODs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; 25 unique meshes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; Ideal for survival games, abandoned streets, police-themed environments, and open-world adventures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Populate your city with vehicles that tell a story. Will your sedan be an abandoned taxi, a sheriff's car, or part of a deserted police scene?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
