      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2d962a6f0126ba4995db31e3da9adfbb34ad5424.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=217b9dc27637c1eb238964cd33023940"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/525bf8d4c24dc3a45f3763557a584f9f08542528.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=ac1f534a4d9e5f04bca48860bed29a2a"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Build your world with Unity&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make video games that look like they took years to design—in no time at all! With this massive collection of tools and assets for Unity, you can fill your games with detail and atmosphere and have them ready to play before you know it. Build complete game worlds with ready-to-use characters, environments, biomes, and props. Explore collections of terrain and environment stamps, design ready-to-use industrial cityscapes, experiment with dynamic lighting and fog effects, and more! Create, experiment, prototype, and bring your ideas to life with a wide variety of production-ready Unity assets, many of which have never been featured in a Humble Bundle before! Get this huge bundle of assets for the price of your choosing, and support the Make-A-Wish Foundation with your purchase!  &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys expire. Please redeem your keys before October 31, 2027. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infinitunesmusiccollectiona_medievalrealinstrumentsongs"&gt;InfiniTUNES Music Collection A - Medieval Real Instrument Songs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infernalking"&gt;Infernal King&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#switchinputdeviceandgamepadmouse"&gt;Switch Input Device &amp; Gamepad Mouse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#boardgamespack"&gt;Board Games Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#arcadevehicleai"&gt;Arcade Vehicle Ai&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#arcadebikep