ls, 45 material instances, 165 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Third-person demo, overview and animation preview maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="demonicwarrior"&gt;&lt;a id="demonicwarrior" href="https://youtu.be/XqCQxgRLDbc"&gt;Demonic Warrior&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/22537f2a-aa2a-4ccc-8ca7-60b60c0026c1"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Erendil, a demonic warrior with a sword, cloth simulation and three color variants. ARKit blendshapes give the face a standard target for facial animation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Erendil character with sword&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;3 color variants&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;APEX cloth simulation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;ARKit blendshapes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;64,135 polys&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No animations included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="zombie_dismemberedcrawlermale"&gt;&lt;a id="zombie_dismemberedcrawlermale" href="https://youtu.be/voVzC4wJKXc"&gt;Zombie - Dismembered Crawler Male&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e682d1ac60cb2fbd227305178e13ab5c5e054d1c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6de1147078626b667bca46c599a55f83"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/53e4100d-6fb2-46ce-b407-158c922e782f"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.22 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A dismembered crawling zombie with two head options. Six texture variations with and without gore, plus 34 animations, cover both grim and clean looks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;34 animations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;6 texture variations (3 gore, 3 clean)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;9 dismemberable limbs, 2 heads&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 skinned models (600 to 11k tris), rigged to the Epic skeleton with IK&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 animation blueprint&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;7 master materials, 19 material instances, 64 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="babyincapsule_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="babyincapsule_fab"&gt;Baby In Capsule&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1449632a263e55475b6b002ae32d41251cd21d77.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e9516e8f932822eeda9f86d26aab0a74"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/b2736f16-1727-472a-aaaf-4c4a678bd9fe"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A baby on a respirator inside a lab capsule with a monitor screen. An unsettling sci-fi horror prop with emissive 4K textures and multiple material options.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Capsule with monitor screen and baby in respirator&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;3 material options each for capsule and baby&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 in-place idle animation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;9 materials and material instances, 15 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures with emissive&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Vertices: baby 8,321, capsule 48,148&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Not rigged to the Epic skeleton&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="semi-permanentblooddroplets"&gt;&lt;a id="semi-permanentblooddroplets"&gt;Semi-Permanent Blood Droplets&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4ffb9f6d6dad0219aafcd103059d52a3b403bc66.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6dabe2b26ee524a6f04f440343dcd0b3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/861928e5-0f4c-41d4-bdd9-01d67be5db87"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.25 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  16 Niagara blood systems for spurts, stabs, punches and gunshot wounds. Everything runs from one blueprint with no fluid simulation and no extra setup, and the whole pack is under 35MB.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;16 CPU Niagara systems: aortic spurt, pool, punch, stab, loops and timed bleeds&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Entrance and exit wounds for pistol, rifle and shotgun&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;14 bonus GPU systems (UE 4.26)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;24-tri droplets, 4-tri decals, no fluid simulation&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;BP_Droplets blueprint&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 master materials, 4 material instances, 3 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="realisticdecomposition"&gt;&lt;a id="realisticdecomposition" href="https://youtu.be/UXMpx6FzTcQ"&gt;Realistic Decomposition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/6965f4a6-d4d9-4fe1-a9e4-334c0b690d32"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.26 - 5.7&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A procedural decomposition system that rots any character on death. Eight fabric-aware decay layers plus Niagara maggots and flies, triggered with a single Begin Decay On Death call.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Works with any skeletal mesh and material. Demo characters are not included.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Eight-layer decomposition with fabric awareness&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Niagara maggots (vertex-animated meshes), flies and decay effect&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;BP_Decay with 47 parameters&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;40 extra material parameters&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Non-destructive, works on existing materials&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;17 textures, under 45MB&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="bulletimpactdecals_combopack"&gt;&lt;a id="bulletimpactdecals_combopack"&gt;Bullet Impact Decals - Combo Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/637fe2299613707230c45b9ebf91ff9b20dd30d4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d17bf6941f2ed2c8d18cb3af8ea480c6"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/d9697e53-4e8f-439e-88fe-d896bdd4cfd5"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.1 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Bullet impact decals for concrete, metal, wood, plaster and high-impact hits. Parallax occlusion mapping gives every hole real depth and self-shadowing, with drag-and-drop placement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;5 volumes: Concrete, Metal, Wood, Plaster, High Impact&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Parallax occlusion mapping with depth and self-shadowing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Adjustable depth and color&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Drag and drop&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 master material, 51 material instances, 2 material functions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;24 textures at 4K&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="humanoidscreaturespack"&gt;&lt;a id="humanoidscreaturespack" href="https://youtu.be/aizaILs1xIo"&gt;Humanoids Creatures Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c51f3efb417957b1c7e7fbb2919a2ea126269ae6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=deee46782b7e4219ea2a42d7ee2f31e1"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/7a115ce2-cb54-4bcb-b1e7-a459f80b3f38"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.7&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Five humanoid creatures for horror and monster games. Full 4K PBR texture sets and 15k to 28k polys per creature keep them practical for populating levels with enemies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;5 humanoid creatures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;41 animations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K PBR textures (albedo, AO, metallic, normal)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;15,052 to 28,098 polys per creature&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="skeletonrigged"&gt;&lt;a id="skeletonrigged"&gt;Skeleton (Rigged)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0065446bdeca2a647013c232cbf2334f57791493.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d5879a21e82258e374960c58afe0ecbf"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A rigged, life-size human skeleton for undead enemies, ragdolls and cinematics, plus a partial-flesh version. UE5 Mannequin bone names and hierarchy let you retarget Mannequin animations with the IK Retargeter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;No animations are included.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 skeletal meshes: bone only (179 cm) and partial flesh&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;161-bone skeleton on the UE5 Mannequin hierarchy, IK and twist bones&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Physics assets on both meshes, ready to ragdoll&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Six texture sets: clean, bloody, burned, mossy, glowing emissive, partial flesh&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mask-driven glow with color, strength and contrast controls&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K PBR textures, 41 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;49,152 and 58,084 tris&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="monstersunderwaterpack"&gt;&lt;a id="monstersunderwaterpack" href="https://youtu.be/IBToix7c9GQ"&gt;Monsters Underwater Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f92c0f93f8432e8376cb4557fbe78c02e80fe9ba.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6d45aec230cab199a673176f00e9de7e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/abbee71a-8ed4-4cc9-afe1-fd92b3028683"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Five tentacled sea monsters for underwater horror or fantasy RPG levels. Each creature is rigged to the Epic skeleton and textured in 4K PBR.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Animations are sold separately and are not included.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;5 creature characters with tentacles&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rigged to the Epic skeleton, tested on each creature&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K PBR textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;16,992 to 48,300 polys per creature&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Suits fantasy RPG or horror projects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="zombie_hazmat"&gt;&lt;a id="zombie_hazmat"&gt;Zombie - Hazmat&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c9eb5250cd30a3feaa86af1d95f17345cdf6b042.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=600c730d5742a1e6453186b83012a013"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/92d9abc7-4028-4b2a-98ea-4c78a8af0e66"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.1 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A zombie in a contaminated hazmat suit, once a frontline defender against the outbreak. Rigged to the Epic skeleton with IK bones, so standard humanoid animations drive it for sci-fi horror and outbreak scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 character, 45,609 vertices&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rigged to the Epic skeleton (UE4), IK bones included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;LODs and auto-generated collision&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;9 materials, 7 material instances, 27 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K PBR textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No animations included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="creepingcreaturespack"&gt;&lt;a id="creepingcreaturespack" href="https://youtu.be/HTikO8NVsbM"&gt;Creeping Creatures Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8e9ec59c2efcdd6bdba054561ff5030e83fbf332.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=69b05c9854149455a9e979e194fb4b5e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/a6c84c82-1c47-4e7f-ad5c-5628cf05bdd1"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Five creeping creatures with attachable, physics-driven guts. Animations drive the upper body while leg physics drags the rest, for a convincing crawl without extra animation work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;5 creature characters&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;32 animations (28 in-place, 4 root motion)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Attachable guts with movement physics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Leg physics for dragging lower bodies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;9 materials and material instances, 36 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;12,550 to 21,255 vertices per character&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="zombiefemale"&gt;&lt;a id="zombiefemale"&gt;Zombie Female&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ce52b27a568b2bed8cb3abda567e30b3294d837c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bace9f4e8b71e594a62817962064d342"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.5 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A female hospital patient zombie in a blood-soaked gown, built for hospital outbreaks and asylum horror. A runtime IK retarget plays any UE5 Mannequin animation on her straight away, with no skeleton setup.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Uses your Mannequin animations through the included retargeter; no animations of her own.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Female patient zombie: body plus hospital gown&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;5 interchangeable hair styles on a strand hair shader&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Runtime IK retarget from the UE5 Mannequin (Quinn)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;One Blueprint with Details panel presets: hair, tint, gore level, dismemberment&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reduced-gore preset for storefront or teen-friendly use&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dismemberment by bone with gore stump masks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Shared folder and skeleton, merges with other Yarrawah zombie packs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Overview and animated demo maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="sci-filinewith3creatures_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="sci-filinewith3creatures_fab" href="https://youtu.be/vQPFpUNLcec"&gt;Sci-Fi Line With 3 Creatures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bdac0ba570c94e4f337bf5bc6fc04733a035adef.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=32d3176d18b488162110cc749d9c6a36"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/fb51619d-404d-44c0-8988-508257d0528c"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A sci-fi conveyor line and three monsters to stage on it. Face morphing and Epic skeleton rigs on every creature make it an instant set piece for a lab or containment facility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 conveyor line and 3 creatures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rigged to the Epic skeleton, tested in UE4 and UE5&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Face morphing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures, emissive on the line and creature 01&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;10,652 to 17,983 polys per creature, 35,922 on the line&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No animations included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="zombies_starvedmaleandfemaletwin-pack"&gt;&lt;a id="zombies_starvedmaleandfemaletwin-pack" href="https://youtu.be/1kS90UJooYI"&gt;Zombies - Starved Male/Female Twin-Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1bd55424113e6e09e88a79476af70173b6faa625.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=731704fca19d1004d5e05439f3a2d525"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/079f3bc0-e287-4500-ab33-e00e0600ce5a"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.23 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A male and female starved zombie pair with full dismemberment and dress-up systems. Dozens of clothing and body variations, 34 animations and AI blueprints make for a varied horde from just two characters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 skinned models (4 heads, 2 bodies)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;34 animations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;7 to 12 dismemberable limbs per zombie&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Clothing variations: cheerleader (15), lingerie bra (8), T-shirt (6), singlet (6), pants (4)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 male and 8 female body variations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Anim, AI, dress-up, gib and dismemberment blueprints for each zombie&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;7 master materials, 79 material instances, 229 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures, Epic skeleton and IK&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="alienswarriorpack_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="alienswarriorpack_fab" href="https://youtu.be/iCvXhy2h4Y8"&gt;Aliens Warrior (Pack)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e0f9c50cad43403e75eb2490a4ab4f61a6f823ce.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1a96eed70fab33d76f2118d384a78153"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/a683cdf2-a1b1-4c35-b788-eeae62c2ed37"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.7&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Five armored alien warriors, each with its own loadout, from guns and a mace to claws and a biomechanical arm weapon. Separate UE4 and UE5 rigs and emissive 4K textures make them a strong enemy roster for sci-fi shooters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;5 alien warrior characters&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Weapons: gun, mace, rifle, twin back-mounted guns, claws, biomechanical arm&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Warrior 03: 3 material options, rifle with 4&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Warrior 05: glowing lava veins&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Separate UE4 and UE5 rigs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures with emissive&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;27k to 79k polys per character&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="zombie_priest"&gt;&lt;a id="zombie_priest"&gt;Zombie - Priest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b3dfbfd3eeed148bbbbd2594f8715444b5221714.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c701da1e413d5ba8954bf5f16695a7b4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/04a16d0e-4995-4eed-aab2-d1ec1e23f44e"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.1 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A zombie priest in tattered clerical garments, a ready-made antagonist for supernatural and dark fantasy settings. Rigged to the Epic skeleton at a light 17,388 vertices, ready for standard humanoid animations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 character, 17,388 vertices&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rigged to the Epic skeleton (UE4), IK bones included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;LODs and auto-generated collision&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;9 materials, 8 material instances, 39 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;PBR textures up to 4K&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No animations included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="monsterincapsule_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="monsterincapsule_fab" href="https://youtu.be/AERsrhAUxpM"&gt;Monster In Capsule&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fa7cecb745c0be4f0c0ba0e1c88ae3f0b51707a1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3d6b1c781dfe0e0f316c09fcde99e234"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/e78e02b4-aeda-4ff4-ad3d-4217fd4a1265"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A monster sealed in a lab capsule, with the scientist who studies it. Face morphing and separate UE4 and UE5 rigs make it a ready-made sci-fi horror lab scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 characters (monster, scientist with tablet) and 1 capsule&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rigged to the Epic skeleton, separate UE4 and UE5 rigs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Face morphing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;7 in-place animations (1 monster, 6 scientist idles)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;16 materials and material instances, 32 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K PBR textures with emissive&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;20,492 to 34,644 vertices per mesh&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="skeletonposes"&gt;&lt;a id="skeletonposes"&gt;Skeleton Poses&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9d10307c2c6890f4596e5bf98b3cc7e5f0feadf6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=eb6fce3d860e24279f812ef5548afdc9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;11 pre-posed human skeletons: standing, slumped, sprawled, sitting and fallen. Drop them into crypts, dungeons and battlefields without any rigging or posing work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;11 posed skeletons, 100 to 241 cm&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Six texture sets: clean, bloody, burned, mossy, glowing emissive, partial flesh&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mask-driven glow with color, strength and contrast controls&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K PBR textures, 38 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nanite with a 4-level LOD fallback&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Collision and lightmap UVs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;49,152 tris per mesh&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="devil_rpg"&gt;&lt;a id="devil_rpg" href="https://youtu.be/Ex_jlazQMwU"&gt;Devil (RPG)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/83a93530-f864-4c2e-8376-ae4b0e635cf9"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A devil built for boss fights, the first character in the Fantasy RPG series. A physics-driven tail and 8K textures hold up even when it is scaled up huge and set in a lava pit.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Devil character, rigged to the Epic skeleton&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tested in UE4 and UE5&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Separate tail mesh with its own bones, animated by physics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Face morphing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Two mesh versions: 324,447 and 147,505 polys&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="zombies_bloatedmalefemale_twinpack"&gt;&lt;a id="zombies_bloatedmalefemale_twinpack" href="https://youtu.be/XePn2Q3OVr0"&gt;Zombies - Bloated Male/Female Twin-Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fa375d4211207cc9a414466642497cf05815f6bc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4a4c91f4fa62ccbaed88cb22929cfe45"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/f48a2b5c-1b29-4876-8d1c-fb170f61f484"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.23 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A male and female bloated zombie pair with dismemberment, gibs and dress-up systems. Masked clothing layers and 34 animations let two characters cover a whole horde.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;4 models, 8 dismemberable limbs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;34 animations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;T-shirt, singlet, skirt, bra and pants, 4 masks per item&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Anim, AI, dress-up, gib and dismemberment blueprints for each zombie&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;10 master pose blueprints&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;7 master materials, 98 material instances, 257 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 demo maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="demonrpg"&gt;&lt;a id="demonrpg" href="https://youtu.be/kWWF8RYzrBs"&gt;Demon (RPG)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/a14d0923-fd1c-4ce7-903c-454266fad406"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A high-detail demon and weapon, the second character in the Fantasy RPG series. 8K textures, face morphing and cloth physics give it the presence for a boss encounter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Demon character plus weapon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rigged to the Epic skeleton, tested in UE4 and UE5&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Face morphing&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cloth physics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8K albedo and emissive textures, 4K on the weapon&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;153,536 polys (demon), 15k polys (weapon)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="zombie_businesssuit"&gt;&lt;a id="zombie_businesssuit" href="https://youtu.be/fgdRazjCFoY"&gt;Zombie - Business Suit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/a7b4c2e9-0ae7-405f-a1be-df8f062c180a"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.25 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Business suit zombies with a seed-based randomizer for instant crowd variety. One outfit component drives 8 characters and 7 outfit variations, backed by 34 mocap animations and custom ragdolls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;8 zombie characters with or without hair, 7 outfit material variations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Seed-based randomizer via the BPC_OutfitControl component&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Master pose single-mesh setup, non-APEX cloth option&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;34 animations (Mocap Online)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Custom ragdolls, 6 morph poses, 3 custom masks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;8 master materials, 21 material instances, 64 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;5 demo maps&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="creaturesinsectspack"&gt;&lt;a id="creaturesinsectspack" href="https://youtu.be/0sSadbKePB4"&gt;Creatures Insects Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5482b5b0541a23ec13bdf95e237a49b173ce5ffe.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fcb67be2ddb9a121253dd9c441a63a26"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/0c0ba07e-09b6-4cc7-bf2b-a7f5f77d7554"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  Five insect-style creatures for fantasy RPG or horror games. Each one is rigged and tested on the Epic skeleton, with PBR textures throughout.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Animations ship with the Unity package only.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;5 insect creature characters&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rigged to the Epic skeleton, tested on each creature&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;PBR textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Suits fantasy RPG or horror projects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="zombie_police"&gt;&lt;a id="zombie_police"&gt;Zombie - Police&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8ba75bf99facea58b2b043b15bb4810799ff4c61.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ab9e00b2b8b58efb08e100ef9bbbd7fb"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/0a7a3a30-49fa-41bc-820b-d38cd068eadf"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.1 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A zombie police officer for apocalyptic and open-world survival games. Realistic uniform and skin detail on an Epic skeleton rig that takes standard humanoid animations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 character, 31,006 vertices&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rigged to the Epic skeleton (UE4), IK bones included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;LODs and auto-generated collision&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;9 materials, 8 material instances, 36 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K PBR textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No animations included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="sci-fiexperimental_fab"&gt;&lt;a id="sci-fiexperimental_fab"&gt;Sci-Fi Experimental&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8e7a5ae8117e6d1a533dc9c28dafc86564edd275.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d37151cc60bfff025b71c357c89cb31d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/38ee23f7-ac92-4e4b-8cdb-09ccd756b2b8"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 4.18 - 5.8&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  An experiment table with animated robotic arms, a beetle monster and three monster heads. A complete mad-science set piece for a lab or alien research facility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Experiment table with animated robotic arms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 beetle monster and 3 monster heads&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 root motion animations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;7 materials and material instances, 19 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Vertices: beetle 39,123, heads 3,146 to 6,211, table 52,948&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Not rigged to the Epic skeleton&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="zombie_construction"&gt;&lt;a id="zombie_construction"&gt;Zombie - Construction&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2fdae7a7aa84a41eb44bcd56658d296c9bfee3ca.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4748f44fefd12dcf639346894efb17c2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.fab.com/listings/8821feaa-88b5-4887-b27f-190fdfaf6012"&gt;More Info&lt;/a&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Supports UE 5.1 - 5.6&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;  A zombie construction worker in hard hat and high-visibility vest, instantly recognizable in urban levels. Weathered clothing and an Epic skeleton rig make him a staple enemy for zombie survival games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 character, 18,881 vertices&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Rigged to the Epic skeleton (UE4), IK bones included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;LODs and auto-generated collision&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;9 materials, 8 material instances, 36 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K PBR textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;No animations included&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="skeletonbonepiles"&gt;&lt;a id="skeletonbonepiles"&gt;Skeleton Bone Piles&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/23797440ff56305286035ad16f94e5f6f0193e2c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=214e165f407c5c5b8576ca95d6cb1816"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;8 bone piles and 5 skull piles for crypts, ossuaries and dungeons. One master material gives every pile six finishes, from clean bone to glowing undead.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;13 meshes: 8 bone piles (59 to 133 cm), 5 skull piles (57 to 106 cm)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Six texture sets: clean, bloody, burned, mossy, glowing emissive, partial flesh&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mask-driven glow with color, strength and contrast controls&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;4K PBR textures, 38 textures&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nanite with a 4-level LOD fallback&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Collision, lightmap UVs, bottom-center pivots&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;15,624 to 54,848 tris per mesh&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
